03963421c972350bea9ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:41:49Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:41:49Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"message":"feat(mapa): plotagem de pontos nítida, modo alta densidade e novo destaque\n\n- Marcadores em SVG nítido (preenchimento translúcido, contorno e aro), sem blur/glow\n- Modo compacto e escala por densidade/zoom para camadas com muitos pontos\n- Destaque de seleção com anéis opacos e halo translúcido, sem animação infinita\n- Hover no SVG interno e elevação do ponto sob o cursor em sobreposições\n- Pulso de destacarElemento sem glow; respeita prefers-reduced-motion\n- Linhas com pontas/junções arredondadas; preenchimento de polígonos mais leve\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"741e1c28ed5fbd739423055c7d65a65cf349e7ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/trees/741e1c28ed5fbd739423055c7d65a65cf349e7ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/commits/b716c92bfbefb9c29d103963421c972350bea9ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github