hibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/16b100ebb72a8c7af38fb154d2576e520c8c95fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:41:22Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:41:22Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"message":"chore(release): versao 2.0.0 e CHANGELOG\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8da228c37a436d75249d89e63d73d801287d28c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/trees/d8da228c37a436d75249d89e63d73d801287d28c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/commits/16b100ebb72a8c7af38fb154d2576e520c8c95fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commit/16b100ebb72a8c7af38fb154d2576e520c8c95fd","node_id":"C_kwDOTpy_y9oAKDE2YjEwMGViYjcyYThjN2FmMzhmYjE1NGQyNTc2ZTUyMGM4Yzk1ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commit/649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc","sha":"649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc"}],"sha":"16b100ebb72a8c7af38fb154d2576e520c8c95fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/16b100ebb72a8c7af38fb154d2576e520c8c95fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:18:02Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:18:02Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"message":"feat(kit): seguranca, acessibilidade, temas, customizacao e tipos para frameworks\n\nAplica as melhorias da avaliacao dos componentes (itens 1 a 8).\n\nSeguranca e uso\n- label de ui-campo-texto/ui-lista-flutuante sempre como texto (corrige XSS)\n- ui-botao form-associated: form=\"id\", fieldset disabled, name/value no submitter,\n  delegatesFocus, repasse de aria-label/aria-description, aria-busy\n- Enter em ui-campo-texto submete o formulario como um input nativo\n- Zero-JS ignora gatilhos disabled/carregando/aria-disabled\n- README: exemplo React corrigido, atributos do catalogo, import map p/ CDN\n\nModal\n- abrir/fechar pelo atributo `aberto` emite eventos, devolve o foco e aplica inert\n- foco inicial em [autofocus] ou no primeiro controle (nao no botao fechar)\n- bloquear-fechamento oculta o fechar; UIBus.fecharModal nao anuncia fechamento falso\n- pilha de modais: o segundo modal aberto nao fica inerte; Esc fecha o ultimo aberto\n\nCustomizacao\n- tokens unificados de fonte (--ui-fonte-base/--ui-fonte-codigo) e escala de raio\n  derivada de --ui-raio-borda (--ui-raio-sm/lg/xl/pill)\n- ::part nos 14 componentes principais, com estados (opcao-selecionada, linha-selecionada)\n\nTemas\n- segue o tema do SO por padrao (prefers-color-scheme); data-tema forca claro/escuro\n- contraste WCAG AA em todos os tokens de texto, inclusive sobre fundos de status\n- regras de tema que nao funcionavam no Shadow DOM (ou so no Chrome) trocadas por tokens\n- UIBus.definirTema(''auto'') e UIBus.obterTema(); tema:alterado quando o SO muda\n\nTeclado e ARIA\n- ui-tabela: cabecalho ordenavel com botao e aria-sort; setas/Home/End/PageUp/PageDown\n  nas linhas com foco movel; Enter/Espaco selecionam; selecao mantida ao ordenar\n- ui-tooltip: aria-description no gatilho, Esc fecha, atraso para alcancar o balao\n\nTipos e manifesto\n- custom-elements.json gerado no build (@custom-elements-manifest/analyzer)\n- tipos React (JSX), Vue (GlobalComponents) e agnosticos gerados do manifesto,\n  verificados por `npm run test:tipos`\n\nAmbiente de testes\n- happy-dom fixado em 20.11.1: versoes posteriores ignoram campos form-associated\n  em form.checkValidity(), e 6 testes de validacao falhavam em instalacoes limpas\n- esbuild 0.28 declarado: o vitest dependia de uma copia extraneous no node_modules\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cfba462fb9f9810422d27669e0a704cd8d9e91f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/trees/4cfba462fb9f9810422d27669e0a704cd8d9e91f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/commits/649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commit/649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc","node_id":"C_kwDOTpy_y9oAKDY0OWVlMmE2Nzc1ODg3NWM5Yzg3M2VmNGVjMGE4OGY4Y2VkMTQyZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commit/9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4","sha":"9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4"}],"sha":"649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/649ee2a67758875c9c873ef4ec0a88f8ced142dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:37:08Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:37:08Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"message":"feat(pacote): preparar publicacao npm como @thibezer/ui-components-kit\n\nEmpacotamento\n- export map canonico: dist/index.js, camadas, forms, feedback, tabela e\n  style.css (ESM .js, CommonJS .cjs, tipos .d.ts); subpaths granulares mantidos\n- remover script prepare (build na instalacao quebrava CI/servidores sem\n  devDependencies); prepublishOnly roda testes e build\n- dist/ui-kit.css autocontido: o build falha se restar qualquer @import\n- pacote publica apenas dist, README e LICENSE (MIT)\n\nElevacao\n- tokens --ui-z-* (workspace-hud, docked-bar, drawer, modal, popover, toast,\n  tooltip) aplicados em modal, drawer, ribbon, menus, select, tooltip, toast,\n  paineis flutuantes e menu de contexto da tabela\n\nAcessibilidade\n- ui-input (alias de ui-campo-texto), ui-select e ui-switch geram IDs unicos\n  e associam o rotulo visivel ao controle nativo; sem atributo label, herdam\n  aria-label ou <label> externo\n\nInclui o componente ui-seletor-mapa-base pendente no working tree.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f8542cd7f0bbd30f04b5c88840be86d51b02c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/trees/7f8542cd7f0bbd30f04b5c88840be86d51b02c1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/commits/9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commit/9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4","node_id":"C_kwDOTpy_y9oAKDlhMmQzMjFlMDZhODI1NzAxMDNkNGEzNDc0ZmVlOGE5MzdlZGNkYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commit/4477d9f0101bd36cb3bb4f76302da3209b1afec3","sha":"4477d9f0101bd36cb3bb4f76302da3209b1afec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/4477d9f0101bd36cb3bb4f76302da3209b1afec3"}],"sha":"9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/9a2d321e06a82570103d4a3474fee8a937edcdc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/commits/4477d9f0101bd36cb3bb4f76302da3209b1afec3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:34:29Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:34:29Z","email":"tsilvabertuchi@outlook.com","name":"thibezer"},"message":"fix(ui-camadas): corrigir busca, selecao, persistencia, teclado e acessibilidade\n\n- busca re-renderiza a arvore (acha feicoes alem do limite de 80, expande grupos)\n- shift+clique respeita busca e limite de linhas exibidas\n- metrica do rodape aparece ao selecionar\n- removerCamada limpa selecao/expansao/drawer; usuario e notificado\n- ids arbitrarios (aspas, colchetes) via buscarPorAtributo\n- persistencia: sem gravar antes de conectar; atributo colapsado vence o estado\n  salvo; valores enviados pelo app vencem a customizacao antiga; debounce em\n  cor e opacidade\n- resizer reinicia ao reconectar e limpa listeners globais\n- cadeado: icone aberto, bloqueio herdado da camada, propagacao para feicoes\n- Esc fecha drawer, ignora campos de texto; excluir pelo rodape pede confirmacao\n- seletor de cor recebe #rrggbb; sanitizarCorCss aceita nomes e sintaxe moderna\n- botao de colapsar no modo flutuante; fallback das miniaturas de mapa base\n- acessibilidade: roles/aria, controles-icone por teclado, navegacao por setas,\n  scroll e foco preservados no render\n- 37 testes de regressao\n\nInclui o novo contrato de eventos (API programatica silenciosa; eventos apenas\nem interacao do usuario) aplicado em paralelo por outra sessao.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b3b5ac7aec4d2896574b37e084c2886bb29ddd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/trees/5b3b5ac7aec4d2896574b37e084c2886bb29ddd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibezer/Componentes-UI/git/commits/4477d9f0101bd36cb3bb4f76302da3209b1afec3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259862636?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thibezer","id":259862636,"login":"thibezer","node_id":"U_kgDOD30wbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thibezer/receiv