riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manin1311/CareerSphereFinal/commits/8a33a2392dddd9c9ec85a80227ea51babf048616/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T14:51:48Z","email":"www.dakshbhavsar3699@gmail.com","name":"DakshBhavsar007"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T14:51:48Z","email":"www.dakshbhavsar3699@gmail.com","name":"DakshBhavsar007"},"message":"fix: resolve testimonials unification, avatar image URLs, mock coding Piston integration, and admin RBAC role mapping\n\n- Testimonials Unification & Stats: Default loadReviews in Testimonials.jsx to fetch all public reviews so rating/stats are identical across all landing pages.\n- Avatar Image Resolution: Updated _sanitize_avatar in reviews.py to allow data:image/ URIs. Added API_HOST resolution and onError fallback in Testimonials.jsx.\n- Practice Mock Coding Piston Integration: Replaced hardcoded setTimeout mock in MockInterviewPage.jsx with backend API route (/api/v1/seeker/mock-interview/run-code) executing real code via Piston sandbox.\n- Admin Panel Data Loading & RBAC: Updated admin_login payload to role ''super_admin'' and updated require_admin_role decorator to treat ''admin'' and ''super_admin'' as equivalent roles, fixing 403 authorization errors on sessions/keys/audit-logs lists.","tree":{"sha":"3b80223e64c13f1439131613b92b059677a3df7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manin1311/CareerSphereFinal/git/trees/3b80223e64c13f1439131613b92b059677a3df7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manin1311/CareerSphereFinal/git/commits/8a33a2392dddd9c9ec85a80227ea51babf048616","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186709069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar