-08-01T12:02:51Z","email":"hemant2747@gmail.com","name":"hemant2747"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:02:51Z","email":"hemant2747@gmail.com","name":"hemant2747"},"message":"Add GitHub Actions workflow deploying all three apps to GitHub Pages\n\n- .github/workflows/deploy.yml: separate build job per micro-frontend\n  (shell, remote-webpack, remote-vite) + fan-in job that assembles the\n  three artifacts into one Pages site (shell at root, remotes under\n  /remote-webpack and /remote-vite) with SPA 404 fallback\n- Sub-path hosting support: VITE_BASE-driven Vite base, router basename\n  from import.meta.env.BASE_URL / PUBLIC_PATH pathname (DefinePlugin)\n- federation-manifest.json now uses a relative remoteEntry path for the\n  vite remote; shell loader resolves manifests directory-safe","tree":{"sha":"bb72359a48d72e5a1006978a78fc3900eb1944ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/git/trees/bb72359a48d72e5a1006978a78fc3900eb1944ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/git/commits/9764325ff7adaf1dbc7d7ab811519a74c133f002","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12770479?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hemant2747","id":12770479,"login":"hemant2747","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzcwNDc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/commit/9764325ff7adaf1dbc7d7ab811519a74c133f002","node_id":"C_kwDOTqJH3toAKDk3NjQzMjVmZjdhZGFmMWRiYzdkN2FiODExNTE5YTc0YzEzM2YwMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/commit/19d27bbfa93702918c48ca027fee6950e684d664","sha":"19d27bbfa93702918c48ca027fee6950e684d664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/commits/19d27bbfa93702918c48ca027fee6950e684d664"}],"sha":"9764325ff7adaf1dbc7d7ab811519a74c133f002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/commits/9764325ff7adaf1dbc7d7ab811519a74c133f002"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12770479?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hemant2747","id":12770479,"login":"hemant2747","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzcwNDc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/commits/19d27bbfa93702918c48ca027fee6950e684d664/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:50:03Z","email":"hemant2747@gmail.com","name":"hemant2747"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:51:47Z","email":"hemant2747@gmail.com","name":"hemant2747"},"message":"Micro-frontend architecture: Webpack MF + Vite federation remotes + Vite shell\n\n- Shell (Vite, :3000) consumes a Webpack 5 Module Federation remote\n  (:3001, products) and a Vite Plugin Federation remote (:3002, users)\n- Three-layer routing: shell home/404/alias redirects (/product/* ->\n  /products/*), wildcard namespace handoff, remote-owned nested routes\n  (/products/list/:id, /users/list/:id)\n- react/react-dom/react-router-dom shared singletons across all apps\n- Content-hashed remoteEntry + federation-manifest.json discovery\n  (no cache busting); .env-driven remote base URLs and API URLs\n- Runtime loadRemote/init loader (virtual:__federation__) + remote registry\n- Auto version bump each build (prebuild), version badges + deployment\n  dashboard on shell home\n- Bundle analysis wired (webpack-bundle-analyzer, rollup-plugin-visualizer)\n- Docs: README.md, SOLID-PRINCIPLES.md, BUNDLE-ANALYSIS.md","tree":{"sha":"f5d1b0a4ac617eeb042596e08563b6d6adef1b68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/git/trees/f5d1b0a4ac617eeb042596e08563b6d6adef1b68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant2747/MICROFRONTEND-WEBPACK-VITE/git/commits/19d27bbfa93702918c48ca027fee6950e684d664","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12770479?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant2747/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hemant2747","id":1277