d v4; @source scanning of @betfin/ui/dist works\n- index.html loses the manual entry <script> (Rsbuild injects it)\n- serve.ts: rsbuild emits to dist/static (was dist/assets)\n- tools.rspack alias { accounts: false }: @wagmi/core/tempo has an optional\n  import(''accounts'') Rspack tries to resolve (Vite/esbuild tolerate it); that\n  connector path is never used by MockHost, so stub it\n\nVerified (headless): builds with MF (mf-manifest.json + remoteEntry), Tailwind\nutilities + Quicksand fonts generated, and the rsbuild remote federates into\nthe VITE host with 0 console errors (proves cross-bundler MF interop).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FH4kpsVtUP6s8Fs2E3WAg2","tree":{"sha":"94e2697dc8482253273ffac2f96cfb8c50c86e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/betfinio/template/git/trees/94e2697dc8482253273ffac2f96cfb8c50c86e95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/betfinio/template/git/commits/bd25f99681f2e812756f3eeb3726c6a66bbe458d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174030660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bf-monster","id":174030660,"login":"bf-monster","node_id":"U_kgDOCl9_RA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-monster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-mon