eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lee-dohyun/lee-dohyun/commits/a10f40c9db0d0bbad40a457521f8e63edacdfaa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:25:03Z","email":"leedohyun1985@gmail.com","name":"leedohyun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:25:03Z","email":"leedohyun1985@gmail.com","name":"leedohyun"},"message":"README: 2026-10-02 실측에 맞춰 갱신 (architecture#33)\n\n구조도 갱신과 같은 단위로 프로필 요약을 실제 상태에 맞춘다.\n\n- 주문 정합성(재고 보상 미결 기록·재시도), 회원 등급(주문 시점 스냅샷) 설계 결정 추가\n- 저장소 수: 개발자 도구 사이트를 포함해 14개, 캐논 배치 13개\n- 메일 인증: DNS 실제 값은 SPF ~all / DMARC p=none 이라 \"-all / reject\" 서술을 걷어내고\n  SPF·DKIM·DMARC 적용 + 내부 발신자 587+SASL 로 정정\n- WAN 포트에 SMTP 추가, SSH 공개키 인증만 허용 명시\n- PostgreSQL 인스턴스 3 → 2 (customer 네임스페이스는 단일 인스턴스에 DB 3개)\n- 공급망 보안에 gitleaks 시크릿 스캔 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79c08da1a0ae630ef4b20f9f60d33ee0aa453940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lee-dohyun/lee-dohyun/git/trees/79c08da1a0ae630ef4b20f9f60d33ee0aa453940"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lee-dohyun/lee-dohyun/git/commits/a10f40c9db0d0bbad40a457521f8e63edacdfaa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205183419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lee-dohyun/gists{/gist_id}"