in Croker"},"message":"Add TODO item: remove stale Firebase-era code now that hosting is k8s","tree":{"sha":"cfda73fdf567414666c7a5993f9e73b37b54781d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/cfda73fdf567414666c7a5993f9e73b37b54781d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/571c340226b0571e8293bc831f96debf4c730285","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/571c340226b0571e8293bc831f96debf4c730285","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDU3MWMzNDAyMjZiMDU3MWU4MjkzYmM4MzFmOTZkZWJmNGM3MzAyODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b","sha":"2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b"}],"sha":"571c340226b0571e8293bc831f96debf4c730285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/571c340226b0571e8293bc831f96debf4c730285"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T09:40:48Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T09:40:48Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Prune completed items from TODO.md\n\nRemoves items already marked [x] (client-profile-service removal,\nCLUSTER_NAME override, shared BFF session cache, dashboard screen,\nand the entire SCDS design-system-extension section) and fixes the\nnow-dangling cross-references left behind, per this file''s own\n\"prune once done\" instruction.","tree":{"sha":"64e8bb29d117d7847f5b9ef50dea8d09b3c714cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/64e8bb29d117d7847f5b9ef50dea8d09b3c714cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDJkOTFhZjFiYjU2NjgwODJjODU0NDRmOTIzM2ZmMWQwZTFjZDQ3NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba","sha":"b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba"}],"sha":"2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/2d91af1bb5668082c85444f9233ff1d0e1cd476b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T08:50:39Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T08:50:39Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Note a possible task-runner follow-up for deploy-local.sh''s skip logic\n\nIts conditional build/deploy is hand-rolled bash + a git-diff hash, not\na real target-based build system -- a lightweight task runner (Task,\nJust) would be a cleaner fit than the current approach if it grows more\nspecial cases, without pulling in something heavier that would cut\nagainst the repos'' intentional independence.","tree":{"sha":"9916e37ac62706cc2a00fdcedc3b72740eda7e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/9916e37ac62706cc2a00fdcedc3b72740eda7e02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKGI2Mzg2MTRiZjFhNGM3OTViN2E4ODJlYmY5OTNmNjc5ODRmNTFmYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae","sha":"be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae"}],"sha":"b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/b638614bf1a4c795b7a882ebf993f67984f51fba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T08:50:25Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T08:50:25Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Skip unchanged repos in deploy-local.sh, check kind-node disk, add -f\n\nEach sibling repo is only rebuilt/redeployed when its git tree (HEAD +\nuncommitted/untracked changes) differs from what was last successfully\ndeployed and its helm release(s) are still actually present -- state\ntracked per repo in .deploy-state/ (gitignored). -f/--force bypasses\nthe skip and rebuilds everything, matching the old unconditional\nbehavior.\n\nAlso checks the kind node''s own disk (not the host''s -- Docker Desktop\nruns its own VM with a disconnected virtual disk, so host free space is\nmeaningless here) and prunes build cache/dangling images plus\nunreferenced images inside the node when low, since repeated \":kind\"\ntag rebuilds silently accumulate old image layers in the node''s\ncontainerd store until it fills and pods start failing writes.","tree":{"sha":"985c3c2c3fd7fecff42aaf713c79ec8e98e6cb2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/985c3c2c3fd7fecff42aaf713c79ec8e98e6cb2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKGJlMzRhZjE2NTQ3NGVkOGFmYTMyODE3YWQxMDM3MjY5YWIxZjUyYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4","sha":"b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4"}],"sha":"be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/be34af165474ed8afa32817ad1037269ab1f52ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:44:21Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:44:21Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Mark CLUSTER_NAME hardcode item done -- all 5 app repos now accept an override","tree":{"sha":"c1d7f86d4bccedeab4532fbd685bb106b81bca17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/c1d7f86d4bccedeab4532fbd685bb106b81bca17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKGIzOTUxMWEyZGJjNDk3ZDAxNDZhMjY1OTlhNGU2NmZiOWUxYTBmZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4","sha":"0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4"}],"sha":"b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/b39511a2dbc497d0146a26599a4e66fb9e1a0fd4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T15:50:08Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T15:50:08Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Add tools/deploy-local.sh: one-command local kind deploy for the whole family\n\nOrchestrates all 6 repos'' own tools/deploy-local.sh in dependency\norder (platform''s shared infra -- Strapi + the new session-cache Redis\ninstance -- first, then the 3 BFF-owning apps, then the 2\nfrontend-only apps) against one shared kind cluster, force-restarts\neach BFF''s deployment after its image rebuild (a static :kind tag\nplus pullPolicy: Never means Kubernetes has no signal to redeploy a\npod on its own when only image content or a ConfigMap-delivered env\nvar changes), then proves each BFF is genuinely reading/writing Redis\nby creating data, killing its pod, and confirming the data survived.\n\nGrew out of a one-off script written to verify the shared-session-cache\nrollout; generalized since no single sibling repo is the natural owner\nof \"deploy everything,\" the same reasoning already justified TODO.md\nand docs/plans/ living at this level.","tree":{"sha":"28614b56b276b16a0086ef02a0f4f58664462404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/28614b56b276b16a0086ef02a0f4f58664462404"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDBhMjNkYzI2YWE2MDI0ZmVmNGY3ZmI0ZGJlYjgxNzZiNTc0NzZkZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969","sha":"51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969"}],"sha":"0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/0a23dc26aa6024fef4f7fb4dbeb8176b57476df4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T12:59:39Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T12:59:39Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Update Shared BFF session cache / pnpm demo:reset status\n\nRedis-backed shared-session-cache is built, published, and live on\nkind (see mfe-pot-platform, mfe-pot-dashboard, mfe-pot-job-bank,\nmfe-pot-employment-insurance). Per-BFF /api/reset exists. Still open:\na new package needs a one-time GitHub Packages \"Manage Actions\naccess\" grant before the 3 BFF repos'' CI/Docker builds can pull it\n(no API for this, UI-only) -- blocking the final image\nrebuild/redeploy to kind; and there''s still no single cross-repo\npnpm demo:reset command.","tree":{"sha":"2f07b2063d4a59af4a8d998a87e87cd10ff33d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/2f07b2063d4a59af4a8d998a87e87cd10ff33d6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDUxYjM5Zjg1MDBlNjY1OGFiMDNjYzM3MTJjMTI0NzZhYjU1ZTY5Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa","sha":"29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa"}],"sha":"51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/51b39f8500e6658ab03cc3712c12476ab55e6969"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:25:16Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:25:16Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Document client-profile-service removal and its tradeoffs\n\nIts data now lives directly in dashboard-bff instead of a separate\nshared service, permanently fixing the /api/payments 502 documented\nhere previously. Flags the \"tell us once\" demo beat as needing a\nredesign, since that data is no longer reachable by job-bank-bff/\nemployment-insurance-bff.","tree":{"sha":"1481ab190aeb0a093ffa427e8952291cbc99435b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/1481ab190aeb0a093ffa427e8952291cbc99435b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDI5YTQyMjZmZGQ0NWMyNjUwNWUxNzRmOTU5YzBkOTk5ZTBiOWIwYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7","sha":"ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7"}],"sha":"29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/29a4226fdd45c26505e174f959c0d999e0b9b0aa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T22:30:12Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T22:30:12Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Document the job-bank React federation debugging session: three root causes and fixes\n\nRecords the full chain found while getting mfe-pot-shell to actually\nmount mfe-pot-job-bank as a routed remote for the first time: job-bank''s\nshared react chunk missing named exports (needsCommonJsPlugin), shell''s\nreact-dom shared chunk hitting an upstream native-federation plugin-\nordering bug (Dynamic require of \"react\"), and shared-ui-scds-core/loader\nnever being declared as a shared subpath. Also reconfirms the\ndeploy-local.sh CLUSTER_NAME=kind bug, now hit a second time in shell.","tree":{"sha":"8066ec7c965da764af479dbeaa9630a18206a8e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/8066ec7c965da764af479dbeaa9630a18206a8e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKGVjMGNkNDIzYWI0ZDBkOTIyM2QxNDNhMGQ3YWUyN2JhMDI1MTI0Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/2050a961048bc7c17c97e6286639122ca263ab07","sha":"2050a961048bc7c17c97e6286639122ca263ab07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/2050a961048bc7c17c97e6286639122ca263ab07"}],"sha":"ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/ec0cd423ab4d0d9223d143a0d7ae27ba025124c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/2050a961048bc7c17c97e6286639122ca263ab07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:30:36Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:30:36Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Check off SCDS-across-the-family items: Angular wrapper regenerated,\nfederation-config pin aligned, employment-insurance adoption done\n\nAll previously-open items under \"Design system extension (SCDS)\" are\nnow complete: shared-ui-scds''s Angular wrapper is regenerated from\nthe Stencil core and published as 0.2.0, shared-federation-config''s\npin is aligned to 0.4.0 across all 5 app repos, and\nmfe-pot-employment-insurance''s 3 ScdsCard candidates are adopted and\nverified live on kind. Also corrects the multi-column-list bullet''s\nnow-stale claim about a per-column TemplateRef escape hatch, which\nthe Stencil rewrite dropped.","tree":{"sha":"1a628907927128888b6cabf9a9e57d30e37426a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/1a628907927128888b6cabf9a9e57d30e37426a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/2050a961048bc7c17c97e6286639122ca263ab07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/2050a961048bc7c17c97e6286639122ca263ab07","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDIwNTBhOTYxMDQ4YmM3YzE3Yzk3ZTYyODY2MzkxMjJjYTI2M2FiMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/c334e8111880