ackages.yml fixes, check off SCDS component rollout, and log job-bank federation bug\n\nDocuments the chain of pre-existing bugs (pnpm-action-setup version, stale\nlockfile, GITHUB_TOKEN package-access limits, case-sensitive publish-skip\ncheck) that had kept the workflow failing on every run, checks off the SCDS\nmulti-column-list/card rollout including the Stencil rebuild for job-bank''s\nReact app, and records a newly-found pre-existing bug where mfe-pot-shell\ncan''t load job-bank as a federated remote.","tree":{"sha":"f677693fe5eaa498e8d1200b2fd5f0a9056acd27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/trees/f677693fe5eaa498e8d1200b2fd5f0a9056acd27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/git/commits/6a3ffda906674758ae6adcad3ec071c21cea438f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/6a3ffda906674758ae6adcad3ec071c21cea438f","node_id":"C_kwDOTqlj_toAKDZhM2ZmZGE5MDY2NzQ3NThhZTZhZGNhZDNlYzA3MWMyMWNlYTQzOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commit/f9fcb8c35c3d7dd98a09a998cca4c804b2151ac9","sha":"f9fcb8c35c3d7dd98a09a998cca4c804b2151ac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/f9fcb8c35c3d7dd98a09a998cca4c804b2151ac9"}],"sha":"6a3ffda906674758ae6adcad3ec071c21cea438f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/6a3ffda906674758ae6adcad3ec071c21cea438f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tn4consulting/mfe-pot/commits/f9fcb8c35c3d7dd98a09a998cca4c804b2151ac9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:39:41Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:39:41Z","email":"mcroker@gmail.com","name":"Martin Croker"},"message":"Check off dashboard screen slice, record cross-cutting design principles, and add SCDS design-system 