Qadi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:01:35Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"message":"Stop tracking dist-element build output\n\nIt slipped in with the element build commit. dist was already ignored; this is\nthe same thing for the second build target.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"517fa30b7fac4ca305d0433da002a5e38aa974bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/trees/517fa30b7fac4ca305d0433da002a5e38aa974bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/commits/646528e6a5abbca4e6eebfd03be691f0926b0cd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi","id":180862618,"login":"Sara-Qadi","node_id":"U_kgDOCse-mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commit/646528e6a5abbca4e6eebfd03be691f0926b0cd3","node_id":"C_kwDOTqyvCNoAKDY0NjUyOGU2YTVhYmJjYTRlNmVlYmZkMDNiZTY5MWYwOTI2YjBjZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commit/70858da88ed166a0cb339e7cacdcab2e3d8cd2e6","sha":"70858da88ed166a0cb339e7cacdcab2e3d8cd2e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/70858da88ed166a0cb339e7cacdcab2e3d8cd2e6"}],"sha":"646528e6a5abbca4e6eebfd03be691f0926b0cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/646528e6a5abbca4e6eebfd03be691f0926b0cd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi","id":180862618,"login":"Sara-Qadi","node_id":"U_kgDOCse-mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/70858da88ed166a0cb339e7cacdcab2e3d8cd2e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:01:20Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:01:20Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"message":"Publish <elan-cart-app> for shell integration\n\nThe team chose Web Components, so the app now ships a second build: one stable,\nunhashed file at /elan-cart-app.js that registers the custom element. The shell\nhardcodes that URL, which is why it must not carry a content hash.\n\nRouting is the part that needed real care. Three microfrontends in one page\nmeans three routers, and three web histories would all grab popstate and fight\nover location. The router is now a factory: standalone keeps web history, the\nelement gets memory history and is driven by a `route` property, reporting back\nwith elan:navigate. The module-level router instance is gone -- it attached a\npopstate listener merely by being imported, which is exactly what the element\nbuild must not do.\n\nLight DOM rather than shadow DOM, because Vuetify teleports dialogs, menus and\nsnackbars to document.body and ships a global stylesheet; inside a shadow root\nthose overlays would render outside the styles that make them readable.\n\nTwo build traps worth recording:\n  - Vite inlines assets as base64 in library mode, and the MDI webfont alone\n    made the bundle 7MB. The element loads that stylesheet from a CDN instead.\n  - Library mode skips the define that replaces process.env.NODE_ENV, so the\n    first bundle died with \"process is not defined\" the moment a browser\n    loaded it.\n\nVerified: the element registers, renders in light DOM, is driven by the route\nproperty, emits elan:navigate on internal navigation, and two instances on one\npage keep separate carts. The standalone build and all its routes still work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3091de05b5e481226f914ef38b4ad7b2b9a3ee2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/trees/3091de05b5e481226f914ef38b4ad7b2b9a3ee2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/commits/70858da88ed166a0cb339e7cacdcab2e3d8cd2e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followe