/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/f4576df12715d47682625853e4005c839831ba5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T21:42:15Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T21:42:15Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"message":"Explain why card fields are empty when returning to payment\n\nUsing Edit on the review screen, or refreshing the payment step, correctly\nclears the card fields because the number and CVV are never stored. That was\nsilent, so the shopper met an empty form with no idea why.\n\nThe payment view now captures whether a saved card summary existed before\nCardPaymentForm mounts and clears it, and shows a short note in that case.\nThe note disappears as soon as the re-entered card validates.\n\nVerified end to end: shipping details and delivery instructions survive the\nEdit round trip, Place Order stays disabled until the confirmation checkbox\nis ticked, and a duplicate click still produces exactly one order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e28612a038e01a18db2d956cb383df1040ac5ee3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/trees/e28612a038e01a18db2d956cb383df1040ac5ee3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/commits/f4576df12715d47682625853e4005c839831ba5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi","id":180862618,"login":"Sara-Qadi","node_id":"U_kgDOCse-mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commit/f4576df12715d47682625853e4005c839831ba5d","node_id":"C_kwDOTqyvCNoAKGY0NTc2ZGYxMjcxNWQ0NzY4MjYyNTg1M2U0MDA1YzgzOTgzMWJhNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commit/e6aa72501425befc09e83a76b711a5eb1af20b45","sha":"e6aa72501425befc09e83a76b711a5eb1af20b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/e6aa72501425befc09e83a76b711a5eb1af20b45"}],"sha":"f4576df12715d47682625853e4005c839831ba5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/f4576df12715d47682625853e4005c839831ba5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi","id":180862618,"login":"Sara-Qadi","node_id":"U_kgDOCse-mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/commits/e6aa72501425befc09e83a76b711a5eb1af20b45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T21:28:25Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T21:28:25Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"message":"Make blocked checkout steps explain themselves\n\nPressing Continue to Payment with an incomplete form appeared to do nothing:\nthe only feedback was a transient snackbar and small inline text on a field\nthat was often scrolled out of view (typically the Country select, the one\nfield that is not a text input).\n\n- Shipping: persistent alert above the form listing every blocking field,\n  a snackbar naming the field, and smooth-scroll + focus to the first error;\n  the alert clears as soon as the shopper starts correcting things\n- Payment: Review Order is no longer disabled. A disabled button gave no clue\n  what was missing and made the existing error handling unreachable; it now\n  blocks and reports what is wrong\n- CardPaymentForm: wrap the fields in a v-form so touchAll() can actually\n  re-run the rules, since flipping the touched flags alone never rendered\n  the messages\n- README: refresh the manual test checklist to match\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37433ca9715d6b4d90e37f7a01d4ab7a3dc02da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/trees/37433ca9715d6b4d90e37f7a01d4ab7a3dc02da0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-card-checkout/git/commit