},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhi5057/DYOJ/commits/6c42c7013b5880b6324cd26fbd9c5bf3defcc0dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:15:10Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:15:10Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Bootstrap Microservices and Microfrontends\n\n- Consolidated infrastructure files (`docker-compose.yml`, `init.sql`, `.env.*`) into a dedicated `dyoj-infra` directory.\n- Bootstrapped the Spring Boot API Gateway and backend microservices (`dyoj-user-service`, `dyoj-catalog-service`, `dyoj-order-service`, `dyoj-tracking-service`, `dyoj-payment-service`, `dyoj-notification-service`) with correct dependencies and explicitly downgraded to a stable version (`3.4.1`) to ensure compilability.\n- Scaffolded the React/Vite Microfrontends (`dyoj-ui-shell`, `dyoj-ui-catalog`, `dyoj-ui-checkout`, `dyoj-ui-dashboard`).\n- Distributed the environment configuration templates (`.env.dev`, `.env.stage`, `.env.prod`) to all newly created service and UI repositories to ensure environment isolation standards are followed.\n\nCo-authored-by: abhi5057 <13493256+abhi5057@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"48dff3a73f6be09f94af33303cc662588ee32e0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhi5057/DYOJ/git/trees/48dff3a73f6be09f94af33303cc662588ee32e0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhi5057/DYOJ/git/commits/6c42c7013b5880b6324cd26fbd9c5bf3defcc0dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/