coded POSTGRES_PASSWORD to a git-ignored .env file for security.\n- Fixed the docker-compose healthcheck to reference the correct dyoj_user_db and removed the orphaned dyoj_db environment variable.\n- Updated ARCHITECTURE.md and DETAILED_ARCHITECTURE.md to explicitly address architectural edge cases: Redis Pub/Sub fanout for WebSockets, stateless JWT verification via JWKS at the Gateway, Stripe webhook signature validation/deduplication, traceId propagation in Kafka headers, Flyway schema migrations, and renaming password to password_hash for clarity.\n\nCo-authored-by: abhi5057 <13493256+abhi5057@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f737a1fe49bab8053392e6b2c87ac7d3f4d834ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhi5057/DYOJ/git/trees/f737a1fe49bab8053392e6b2c87ac7d3f4d834ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhi5057/DYOJ/git/commits/b0d236a5c629f1f74d95c046af1e1a8d2b4e0090","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use