repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commits/14a6ae7427ebd356b335fc938b69699081065273/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:12:12Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:12:12Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"message":"fix: 显式关闭企业版用户全局拉取开关，修复数据管理页引用解析崩溃\n\nFEATURE_FLAGS_DEFAULT_VALUE=True 会让未在 feature_flags.json 中声明的 flag\n默认判定为开启。企业版 flag\n`fflag_all_feat_utc_204_users_performance_improvements_in_dm_for_large_orgs`\n因此被误判为开启，导致前端 AppStore 跳过 fetchUsers()，users 数组为空，\n任务 annotators 的裸 user ID 引用无法解析，抛出\n\"Failed to resolve reference ''N'' to type ''User''\"。\n\n在 label_studio/feature_flags.json 中显式将该 flag 置为 on:false，\n恢复全局用户拉取，引用得以正常解析。","tree":{"sha":"1b873b8b7ca69db0860226bba294d825169db4d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/trees/1b873b8b7ca69db0860226bba294d825169db4d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/commits/14a6ae7427ebd356b335fc938b69699081065273","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237421954?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jiazz197-cmyk","id":237421954,"login":"jiazz197-cmyk","node_id":"U_kgDODibF