}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commits/f029ed56b9255d6cf0af04ab320916050ecee438/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:29:12Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:29:12Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"message":"fix: 修复 MinIO 模式下图片 URL 畸形导致标注页无法加载\n\n根因: HOST 为空时 AWS_S3_CUSTOM_DOMAIN 被拼成 ''/data'',\nS3Boto3Storage 生成 https:///data/upload/... 空主机名 URL,\n浏览器请求失败, 前端报 ERR_LOADING_HTTP.\n\n修复:\n- MinIO 分支 BACKEND 改用 core.storage.CustomS3Boto3Storage,\n  图片 URL 走 Django 代理 /storage-data/uploaded/,\n  客户端无需直连 MinIO, 任意终端均可加载\n- HOST 为空时 AWS_S3_CUSTOM_DOMAIN 置空, 从源头杜绝畸形 URL","tree":{"sha":"aeed45d22241485b2a3b06b41c26d404cf39a2e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/trees/aeed45d22241485b2a3b06b41c26d404cf39a2e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/commits/f029ed56b9255d6cf0af04ab320916050ecee438","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237421954?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jiazz197-cmyk","id":237421954,"login":"jiazz197-cmyk","node_id":"U_kgDODibFgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/received_events","repos