"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commits/8ce3e84fd5406a0beb818197403d478641835f7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T12:22:28Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T12:22:28Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"message":"将 Label Studio 品牌全面重塑为 Yamato，同时修复 Windows 开发环境兼容性\n\n品牌重塑：\n- 新增 PRODUCT_NAME=\"Yamato\" Django 设置，替换全部用户可见 \"Label Studio\" 文本\n  （模板、后端 Python、React 前端、PWA manifest、CLI 输出、README）\n- 颜色主题：design-tokens.json 主色 grape->blueberry，强调色 persimmon/canteloupe->blueberry，\n  保留 error=persimmon(红)、warning=canteloupe(琥珀)，重新生成 tokens.prefix.css/tokens.js\n- 图标：yamato_icon.png 生成 favicon(16/32/48) + logo SVG(base64 嵌入)，替换登录页/菜单栏/错误页/manifest\n- 移除 Heidi 负鼠吉祥物，错误页改为 Yamato logo + 友好提示\n- 移除外部分析（Google Analytics、labelstud.io iframe），COLLECT_ANALYTICS 默认 False\n- 移除登录页 HumanSignal 署名（保留 LICENSE/NOTICE）\n- CLI 命令 label-studio->yamato，npm 包名 @humansignal/source->@yamato/source\n- Sentry release_name、webpack uniqueName 改为 yamato\n\nWindows 兼容性：\n- .env 中 BASE_DATA_DIR 改为 Windows 路径格式（C:\\... 而非 /mnt/c/...）\n- web/package.json 所有 scripts 用 cross-env 替代 Unix KEY=VALUE 语法\n- playground:build 用 node fs.renameSync 替代 mv 命令\n- secret_key.py 加文件存在检查，避免 data/.env 不存在时的无谓警告\n- AGENTS.md 补充 Windows 开发环境说明及 PowerShell 等价命令\n\n不改动：label_studio/ Python 包名、Django app labels、version keys、\nimport 路径、迁移文件、LICENSE/NOTICE（保留 Apache-2.0 署名）","tree":{"sha":"de0bd85c9368849fd27a95c458d89683cbd4d1bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/trees/de0bd85c9368849fd27a95c458d89683cbd4d1bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/commits/8ce3e84fd5406a0beb818197403d478641835f7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237421954?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jiazz197-cmyk","id":237421954,"login":"jiazz197-cmyk","node_id":"U_kgDODibFgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commit/8ce3e84fd5406a0beb818197403d478641835f7d","node_id":"C_kwDOTq_ON9oAKDhjZTNlODRmZDU0MDZhMGJlYjgxODE5NzQwM2Q0Nzg2NDE4MzVmN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commit/177f6dd5c0b31de36d2f074703734f73f3753b6b","sha":"177f6dd5c0b31de36d2f074703734f73f3753b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commits/177f6dd5c0b31de36d2f074703734f73f3753b6b"}],"sha":"8ce3e84fd5406a0beb818197403d478641835f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commits/8ce3e84fd5406a0beb818197403d478641835f7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237421954?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jiazz197-cmyk","id":237421954,"login":"jiazz197-cmyk","node_id":"U_kgDODibFgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiazz197-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/commits/177f6dd5c0b31de36d2f074703734f73f3753b6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:38:42Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:38:42Z","email":"jiazz197@gmail.com","name":"carljia"},"message":"修复前端样式在 Windows 下完全不渲染的问题\n\nwebpack.config.js 中用 includes(\"/css-loader/\") 查找 css-loader，\n但 Windows 路径用反斜杠（\\css-loader\\），导致永远匹配不到。\n.prefix.css 规则从未被创建，BEM 类名从未被加 lsf- 前缀，\nCSS 选择器（.menu-header）与 JS 生成的类名（lsf-menu-header）不匹配，\n434 个组件无样式。\n\n- 三处 includes(\"/css-loader/\") 改为 match(/[/\\\\]css-loader[/\\\\]/)\n- getLocalIdent 显式返回前缀类名，不依赖 undefined 回退行为\n- 移除 include: template.include 限制，避免漏匹配","tree":{"sha":"0f66fe5e495abfe31d57c0264272738b7953e739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiazz197-cmyk/project_yamato_label2model/git/trees/0f66f