rl":"https://api.github.com/users/IhorChukhal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IhorChukhal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IhorChukhal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/6f62eafeccf57245ffc0ddb8d19bd83c2daac445/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:49:44Z","email":"ihor@unikk.me","name":"IhorChukhal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:49:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Allow resetting screening responses only when not eligible (#358)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nStaff need a way to reset a screening response only when it made the\nparticipant not eligible, so eligible responses cannot be reset by\nmistake.\n- Show Reset response in the questionnaire card 3-dot menu only for\nnot-eligible screening submissions\n- Require a confirmation dialog before resetting\n- Enforce the not-eligible restriction on the server\n- After reset, set participant status to Onboarding started and make the\nscreening onboarding task available again\n- Update the confirmation dialog copy, remove the icon, and use the\nprimary button style\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","tree":{"sha":"5da49f31ee96099784cd5b2d41905c1f2b4820b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/trees/5da49f31ee96099784cd5b2d41905c1f2b4820b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/commits/6f62eafeccf57245ffc0ddb8d19bd83c2daac445","verification":{"payload":"tree 5da49f31ee96099784cd5b2d41905c1f2b4820b8\nparent 15433fee214d4882095a70486b56c828976a87b8\nparent a9e21b126469557dc266f93a572f47859dd2dc1c\nauthor IhorChukhal <ihor@unikk.me> 1783802984 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783802984 +0300\n\nAllow resetting screening responses only when not eligible (#358)\