to see at a glance when a submitted screening response\nresulted in \"Not eligible\", without opening the response details.\n\n- Expose `isEligible` on questionnaire response results for screening\nsubmissions\n- Show a \"Not eligible\" badge next to the Submitted status on the\nscreening questionnaire card when `isEligible` is false\n- Hide the badge when the participant is eligible or the questionnaire\nis not a screening type\n\nChecklist\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","tree":{"sha":"13d02502233b180875ec9068eb2ec0ac073cef41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/trees/13d02502233b180875ec9068eb2ec0ac073cef41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/commits/eac5616624c0dd2decd1139e8b88f1c84c3da761","verification":{"payload":"tree 13d02502233b180875ec9068eb2ec0ac073cef41\nparent d730343f236142eacfb3bed8a8d1b2d219dcbc0f\nparent e91b6af492cf84664f93304cd0b1677c4b61c84a\nauthor IhorChukhal <ihor@unikk.me> 1783796597 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783796597 +0300\n\nShow not eligible badge on screening questionnaire cards (#356)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nStaff need to see at a glance when a submitted screening response\nresulted in \"Not eligible\", without opening the response details.\n\n- Expose `isEligible` on questionnaire response results for screening\nsubmissions\n- Show a \"Not eligible\" badge next to the Submitted status on the\nscreening questionnaire card when `isEligible` is false\n- Hide the badge when the participant is eligible or the questionnaire\nis not a screening type\n\nChecklist\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUpN1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeG0QADl7CAbiKEKVw40xX8KprAbY\nHB3pIPpUhTbt8H0DChjs3kd5ekAQOu6klv9FlsB/M8Sm1r43TvTFcYhtfLY86UuU\nmwF2kfWLjAf4GrDm