993d12f8785ff9a7e8f","node_id":"C_kwDOTrP1ydoAKGZhOWVjNmIxM2EyYzM4NGUwMjcyMDk5M2QxMmY4Nzg1ZmY5YTdlOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kosumaster/DataMentor/commit/d730343f236142eacfb3bed8a8d1b2d219dcbc0f","sha":"d730343f236142eacfb3bed8a8d1b2d219dcbc0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/d730343f236142eacfb3bed8a8d1b2d219dcbc0f"}],"sha":"fa9ec6b13a2c384e02720993d12f8785ff9a7e8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/fa9ec6b13a2c384e02720993d12f8785ff9a7e8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204223779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alina9k","id":204223779,"login":"alina9k","node_id":"U_kgDODCw1Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/d730343f236142eacfb3bed8a8d1b2d219dcbc0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:28:26Z","email":"alina@unikk.me","name":"Alina Kazmirchuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:28:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Restore public API key functionality for tenants (#351)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nRestore the ability for tenant owners to manage a public API key, which\nwas lost when the `api_key` and `api_key_created_at` columns dropped out\nduring the PlatformPlatform consolidation merge.\n\n- Add owner-only endpoints to generate and delete a tenant API key, plus\nan anonymous backend-to-backend endpoint that exchanges an API key for a\nshort-lived public API access token\n- Reintroduce the `ApiKey` and `ApiKeyCreatedAt` fields on the tenant\naggregate and expose them on the current-tenant query\n- Add an idempotent migration that re-adds the two columns with `IF NOT\nEXISTS` so databases created before and after the consolidation merge\nconverge\n- Add an API key section to account settings where owners can generate,\nview, copy, regenerate, and delete a key\n- Collect telemetry for key generation, deletion, and exchange outcomes\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","tree":{"sha":"48af4455c197e5c8d291f62d8fa877246b2cadff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/trees/48af4455c197e5c8d291f62d8fa877246b2cadff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/commits/d730343f236142eacfb3bed8a8d1b2d219dcbc0f","verification":{"payload":"tree 48af4455c197e5c8d291f62d8fa877246b2cadff\nparent 1c3dd566bec766944850cb478fa401088af6f594\nparent 3ba1b6ecfbcda4240a532411249a6cf9828b235a\nauthor Alina Kazmirchuk <alina@unikk.me> 1783592906 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783592906 +0300\n\nRestore public API key functionality for tenants (#351)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nRestore the ability for tenant owners to manage a public API key, which\nwas lost when the `api_key` and `api_key_created_at` columns dropped out\nduring the PlatformPlatform consolidation merge.\n\n- Add owner-only endpoints to generate and delete a tenant API key, plus\nan anonymous backend-to-backend endpoint that exchanges an API key for a\nshort-lived public API access token\n- Reintroduce the `ApiKey` and `ApiKeyCreatedAt` fields on the tenant\naggregate and expose them on the current-tenant query\n- Add an idempotent migration that re-adds the two columns with `IF NOT\nEXISTS` so databases created before and after the consolidation merge\nconverge\n- Add an API key section to account settings where owners can generate,\nview, copy, regenerate, and delete a key\n- Collect telemetry for key generation, deletion, and exchange outcomes\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT3fKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa2AQAIDZynLhDEXu59QezJAWvbUd\nAARjbaAcd8izq1DqOwIUYoTHbKjE6CpPK/KtKTIc/za96Y/vQGcv3/1nSNhN6Klj\nPanveV874fVX+Of/tHiGbLdOyE8hSqYG9QWaW3M/VzP6LcH2Z0hsTGVA5i8iTRmk\nXpmZyHu6ddLPRtvac1GpnGT9e1A1Ar14Xxsstze+s3JiGUEE89VT3hYaWkBS7LwS\nkR8fI6R4XYj5E/y7vqv1v1h6QfIxr2r/rCjzYB1cOVh3RuZ7zZu2EefvKQqz2s7t\nwwQAqQxZXAKw/DvJtAfH5hBmPMRQrMSr+GdVJBpp4b5Tf0wtFboOZ+0yopIlsZiB\n3HLgn4Csds5lA2gqLPxz342dvci5BNXZSL5DD5lvCh2vKEYBxBVhz89ncfkUq7yo\nbiadR4iZ+bp1X0Mhj0D998N+W1gHSpD1zRt50W0CLyjfAErmAMfeDR8AS44VcKE7\ndidqcIxN+Bv7xPST9++8DzjSuTQ0IWkh8ri8EmJzWI3bCWmlcewpI22qv7zCmuaY\nB4YMUTa4X8tzvymM96Q8paYb0yBwf73yfdGlNjqQ1K3gi5y17+l896QsIcCPvi2O\nbKMKhCcKOMm583F15IkH+EGQXYRGjMT631jJa/rbKoWXb3YQpvl4pi3NMjRqvntY\nmvwZZTYl7iUiwHHB/Cln\n=mjGo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T17:27:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"htt