f92d3"}],"sha":"482a64c872157c1d122418655b2db55c3c9d8f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/482a64c872157c1d122418655b2db55c3c9d8f27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204223779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alina9k","id":204223779,"login":"alina9k","node_id":"U_kgDODCw1Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/f4151fdecc9321313f923cd06101a09f2d2f92d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:25:13Z","email":"alina@unikk.me","name":"Alina Kazmirchuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:25:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update to latest PlatformPlatform with feature flags, consolidated back-office, and Agent Teams workflow (#349)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nBring DataMentor up to date with the latest PlatformPlatform baseline by\nmigrating 25+ upstream changes and restoring all DataMentor\ncustomizations on top of the new foundation.\n\nMajor upstream changes:\n\n- Add a feature flag system with back-office administration, tenant\nowner self-service, plan gating, and A/B rollout buckets\n- Consolidate the back-office into the account self-contained system\nwith Entra ID authentication, and add a tenant overview with billing\nevent ledger and reconciliation\n- Rebuild the agentic workflow on Claude Code Agent Teams with dedicated\nteam-lead, guardian, architect, engineer, reviewer, and QA agents\n- Replace the developer CLI MCP server with per-command Claude Code\nskills, and add skills for database queries, branch rebuilds, and\npreparing changes for review\n- Localize transactional emails with a Scriban template pipeline and add\na custom email domain to Azure Communication Services\n- Speed up backend tests with a shared-host test architecture and SQLite\nsnapshot restore instead of per-test database reseeding\n- Centralize branding behind configuration and assets, and local\ndevelopment port allocation behind a configurable base port\n- Add Aspire hostname routing for app and back-office subdomains\n- Improve Application Insights telemetry with deployment stamping and\nprobe filtering, and add an Application Insights MCP integration\n- Refine shared-webapp components, move shared translations into Shared\nWebApp, and refactor form dialogs with DialogForm\n- Upgrade backend, frontend, and GitHub Actions dependencies to latest\nversions\n\nDataMentor-specific changes:\n\n- Restore Ema, questionnaire, and engagement feature customizations on\nthe new baseline and migrate call sites to the re-vendored shared UI\ncomponent APIs\n- Prompt iOS Safari participants to install the native app from the App\nStore\n- Add the JitBit helpdesk system feature flag and allow embedding emails\nin the main self-contained system\n- Update staff email templates (logo, policy link, unknown user\ntemplate), fix table header hover and sort styling, and render the app\nshell only once to fix a duplicate invitation banner\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","tree":{"sha":"2d50d98daabce6430415b14996e9bb0867d4940d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/trees/2d50d98daabce6430415b14996e9bb0867d4940d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/commits/f4151fdecc9321313f923cd06101a09f2d2f92d3","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d50d98daabce6430415b14996e9bb0867d4940d\nparent 82e500db809a994a47c21328516492008eff7441\nparent ce582c768ac795f3f45e9687b2ec908f09b14814\nauthor Alina Kazmirchuk <alina@unikk.me> 1783455913 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783455913 +0300\n\nUpdate to latest PlatformPlatform with feature flags, consolidated back-office, and Agent Teams workflow (#349)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nBring DataMentor up to date with the latest PlatformPlatform baseline by\nmigrating 25+ upstream changes and restoring all DataMentor\ncustomizations on top of the new foundation.\n\nMajor upstream changes:\n\n- Add a feature flag system with back-office administration, tenant\nowner self-service, plan gating, and A/B rollout buckets\n- Consolidate the back-office into the account self-contained system\nwith Entra ID authentication, and add a tenant overview with billing\nevent ledger and reconciliation\n- Rebuild the agentic workflow on Claude Code Agent Teams with dedicated\nteam-lead, guardian, architect, engineer, reviewer, and QA agents\n- Replace the developer CLI MCP server with per-command Claude Code\nskills, and add skills for database queries, branch rebuilds, and\npreparing changes for review\n- Localize transactional emails with a Scriban template pipeline and add\na custom email domain to Azure Communication Services\n- Speed up backend tests with a shared-host test architecture and SQLite\nsnapshot restore instead of per-test database reseeding\n- Centralize branding behind configuration and assets, and local\ndevelopment port allocation behind a configurable base port\n- Add Aspire hostname routing for app and back-office subdomains\n- Improve Application Insights telemetry with deployment stamping and\nprobe filtering, and add an Application Insights MCP integration\n- Refine shared-webapp components, move shared translations into Shared\nWebApp, and refactor form dialogs with DialogForm\n- Upgrade backend, frontend, and GitHub Actions dependencies to latest\nversions\n\nDataMentor-specific changes:\n\n- Restore Ema, questionnaire, and engagement feature customizations on\nthe new baseline and migrate call sites to the re-vendored shared UI\ncomponent APIs\n- Prompt iOS Safari participants to install the native app from the App\nStore\n- Add the JitBit helpdesk system feature flag and allow embedding emails\nin the main self-contained system\n- Update staff email templates (logo, policy link, unknown user\ntemplate), fix table header hover and sort styling, and render the app\nshell only once to fix a duplicate invitation banner\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTWCpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALW8QAE7vZfTG++VxgRCha9u21reo\n1RBUZ8Fw4C3axyqKzahsj30/xjau9wO8G9YBye3+9SLi+ejPzKxEbGPtPKcUtQhN\nUNe4XKuhDtem/46VzlNMMPuOC/8wElhk0+hW3hNrKPX6dUmIVdZK9fyDR6LsacdF\ntjiCt6Li4OrxEVogKc+sVe+hI1moAuVm3DDLRYTRyKVx64ptjTsFIBwASGCpfno5\nm9ewXmGTNSc0F0Uzhb7cGmTqHRcgLHuvG0cS+gddQdrFHySElzdMaUHAuUsUfkEP\ncpHeYgt0+ZHrOAifFXnV8g/wV6NEFfcBg8YDXzEfrzFt6mVTte9pYd38xhp48rtC\njkmOmcGU1TQ5tymQdwpLe18vaEV/QzqUWkQm8X2b5pUZCunMP10e2FnnpGmf8jyv\nV9b7Uxh+vStxsJOFkIqkGc+mbC9q6WRegn0UhGzFYfykWXfgiGjXL6G+Pb3uOuD1\nqHBYOmJWy1afwhkdxvCmepSbvfLcwkbzYeaF/mv+0Dcr5bRp3XZZLEC1mYTt/f6p\nSfjJmoDW1BF7VjRcgPBrH8ufPDEJ2o3EeYGiotPNbDJLo0mgnc6y29U339v4ls/Q\nOadnZ0E5yKg0VXeRUt6fUwHItSp+GmifwL9sQv5hyGps4jubKWAOLk9TQ/AcjpYu\nFfHJ+6e7aGV8j/XWZX54\n=b2QG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T17:26:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"