GM3MTAzOGI0MDlhYTI3YzA1MjBiMTM5ZjZhYTk2Y2E5NzkzNDRlZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kosumaster/DataMentor/commit/2a1bccbd4183223d39e7cd36aaab4f460a904fc3","sha":"2a1bccbd4183223d39e7cd36aaab4f460a904fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/2a1bccbd4183223d39e7cd36aaab4f460a904fc3"}],"sha":"c71038b409aa27c0520b139f6aa96ca979344ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/c71038b409aa27c0520b139f6aa96ca979344ed9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204223779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alina9k","id":204223779,"login":"alina9k","node_id":"U_kgDODCw1Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alina9k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/commits/2a1bccbd4183223d39e7cd36aaab4f460a904fc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T11:08:05Z","email":"alina@unikk.me","name":"Alina Kazmirchuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T11:08:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add filter for participants without open flags (#345)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nExtend the participants list endpoint so staff can filter to\nparticipants who have no open flags, complementing the existing filter\nby open flag severity. The flag filter previously offered only High,\nMedium, and Low, leaving no way to view the participants that have\nnothing requiring attention.\n\n- Add an optional `WithoutOpenFlags` boolean parameter to\n`GetParticipantsQuery`, modeling flag absence as a predicate that is\northogonal to the `OpenFlagSeverities` membership filter\n- Apply the new filter in `ParticipantEngagementRepository.SearchAsync`,\nwhere it composes with the severity filter using OR semantics: a\nparticipant matches when they have an open flag of a selected severity,\nor when they have no open flags at all\n- Treat resolved flags as absent, consistent with how open flag counts\nare calculated\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","tree":{"sha":"cc24e60debdad7bc04046c7a7893050961c19fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/trees/cc24e60debdad7bc04046c7a7893050961c19fa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kosumaster/DataMentor/git/commits/2a1bccbd4183223d39e7cd36aaab4f460a904fc3","verification":{"payload":"tree cc24e60debdad7bc04046c7a7893050961c19fa4\nparent 71efae6dec1d5c1c4e399ba5f1b80ffe963bc63b\nparent 255c99eaa7a9e7d416fdb6d91ac8355fa2580099\nauthor Alina Kazmirchuk <alina@unikk.me> 1782299285 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782299285 +0300\n\nAdd filter for participants without open flags (#345)\n\n### Summary & Motivation\n\nExtend the participants list endpoint so staff can filter to\nparticipants who have no open flags, complementing the existing filter\nby open flag severity. The flag filter previously offered only High,\nMedium, and Low, leaving no way to view the participants that have\nnothing requiring attention.\n\n- Add an optional `WithoutOpenFlags` boolean parameter to\n`GetParticipantsQuery`, modeling flag absence as a predicate that is\northogonal to the `OpenFlagSeverities` membership filter\n- Apply the new filter in `ParticipantEngagementRepository.SearchAsync`,\nwhere it composes with the severity filter using OR semantics: a\nparticipant matches when they have an open flag of a selected severity,\nor when they have no open flags at all\n- Treat resolved flags as absent, consistent with how open flag counts\nare calculated\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have added tests, or done manual regression tests\n- [x] I have updated the documentation, if necessary","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqO7qVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZXwQAFZa6dSiTsUFcu9fjKTUxcBJ\ngVmOkwGumeRplGguxVBCinqzFIhUjSlsmcLoVUD5qxyveNk7UdZeJS8kdstr93+5\nVARlNgUmVpk71IKhf9RFXUr0bOnquUXcStQN22unYbriMz3ZEig0tzqHeg7DfmfS\nl7Ti0sf/ud1oKuLLCmqS9cCvKzBjuuRESRTb6oxO1wA+cBTVMOE+oi6dT4DwOw+8\nV2+2xGxaMOp6u5QH54IRDszseuiwnhIS7JooS02nlngYassjrhq0oJOZJtyW8IR2\nBJUyrFZ13CRqMw4LsBudR2qQqmgLP7K9oVBwASVp175e3O/NWGY/k7sALOsJpJKP\nymAd6FI/Tj5ma5a6HMS35ka6/nzU+d8mAizaC58OD8xG2xF04SQdVItwDG0URBhX\nVNp6FnLSiWwTnFujCdsb9CcXLT/h72xrVDCEjlKojf+SEwglG6YdDYDFiWt4lyhg\nmHlgrou5a7vbXzFC1kFv5mfUO66g4gPHgskUHXu228QDN0Gy3o9Oc+pB7PHHQpye\ndGWA656PaKCGvmrJPFHSwkNX1jTXcyUZgg3EEj/jA54FZ4P18cP668IAMs44TzVk\nGfvzD5JPLxw9c4kzJkFtiPf2vkc3lricNAcB5xZBuhzd1wbfuAvfuczuQEDKspX6\nRffCQ5F8+IKpuZgoR0/s\n=1Wc+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T17:27:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use