}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/c531f53afdd8baf2ccfad949193ab1410e088884/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T01:40:40Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T01:40:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(repo): record the cross-remote demo, and link every choice to its ADR (#49)\n\nThe README''s headline claim — a role change in admin moving dashboard''s\nKPI live, with no reload and no import between the remotes — had been a\n\"pending\" placeholder since launch prep. It is now the real thing:\ncaptured from the running app, two actual browser tabs, 1,204 -> 1,205.\n\nTwo tabs rather than one view, because that is the harder and more\nhonest demo: it crosses the BroadcastChannel relay, so it shows the\nremotes share no state at all.\n\nAdds badges and a stack table where every choice links the ADR that made\nit, which turns the ADRs from a folder nobody opens into the README''s\nown evidence. Deliberately no competitor comparison table: those claims\nrot, and being wrong about someone else''s project in your own README is\nworse than saying nothing.","tree":{"sha":"79ab4c1dde994f49b049e39872256fbfe7a4a605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/79ab4c1dde994f49b049e39872256fbfe7a4a605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/c531f53afdd8baf2ccfad949193ab1410e088884","verification":{"payload":"tree 79ab4c1dde994f49b049e39872256fbfe7a4a605\nparent 6f7768918b3a92cc0d37fb60f1f4e1277e800e88\nauthor Rodrigo Vieira <rodrigodenizads@gmail.com> 1786671640 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786671640 -0300\n\ndocs(repo): record the cross-remote demo, and link every choice to its ADR (#49)\n\nThe README''s headline claim — a role change in admin moving dashboard''s\nKPI live, with no reload and no import between the remotes — had been a\n\"pending\" placeholder since launch prep. It is now the real thing:\ncaptured from the running app, two actual browser tabs, 1,204 -> 1,205.\n\nTwo tabs rather than one view, because that is the harder and more\nhonest demo: it crosses the BroadcastChannel relay, so it shows the\nremotes share no state at all.\n\nAdds badges and a stack table where every choice links the ADR that made\nit, which turns the ADRs from a folder nobody opens into the README''s\nown evidence. Deliberately no competitor comparison table: those claims\nrot, and being wrong about someone else''s project in your own README is\nworse than saying nothing.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfnIYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuvoQAIoCa3fCuCB3DMVO3T5fDEw3\nihVG5AvZvxBOKj+VOGc0us2Sd6KXJQG9YJvBjggcvjGA7bFQNTWLwrqg4l2khmh4\nojtm7+gth2Zgu9o9aU7OzAOkEN1eArjB226DQrtJzmrqBFg/oOiP9rzpF34SP5K8\nqnCTYxq+O9By+olHToZcUeWbqVX6Ao2wt68vHo6uMFvd/N9+HFLPtpstJCA6FFQJ\nIgti0ZvN0+Di8EutM3viLYXMBgEk9qmp8z9165XB/DbnGdQVADUnsFbt461OX4MJ\nmC/amS63gFesWnudRlwmsKTp0ouOcQMt35rqgMJ74nYAy/J607XM8tm+4JqY4gJn\nbWOFdNPYZ1oOxTmC6LIbg2w93rf1o61qaihHVX6iwv/g5K0dTCZka2Ynv62WcsVb\nacsujp1oQY7MC6BL7RukQcIRCT/+/WtSazp1Yc+4m4qROHo7amiNkXsbqOvRxVYU\nay4bPrwgerZZ6CZHL+MOrGNyUxXjD0DrlugetPQ1WjTLQgBmb0awxg3lqQT+HY1p\nJBaGaj3uWHi8m3I5N71g6JAsazcPfLQeCwt+p04FzsAb2UjDDruOa