ieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f","sha":"fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f"}],"sha":"615125368d50fb07383f27e39604ecb559a97d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/615125368d50fb07383f27e39604ecb559a97d96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T01:38:16Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T01:38:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(repo): disable Dependabot (ADR-0016) (#36)\n\nPer user direction, after Dependabot''s first day active opened seven\nPRs in quick succession — one a real problem (@types/node''s major\nbump, unrelated to engines.node, closed separately in PR #33/#28''s\nfollow-up), the rest routine noise. Deletes .github/dependabot.yml\nand closes every open Dependabot-authored PR (#27, #30, #32, #34,\n#35).\n\nosv-scan and Socket (also from ADR-0015) are unaffected — they run on\nevery push/PR independent of Dependabot''s weekly cycle, and still\nsatisfy the CVE/supply-chain-scanning half of the blueprint''s\n\"Dependabot/Renovate, Socket all wired into CI\" DoD line. Dependabot\nspecifically is what''s disabled. ADR-0015 gets a status note pointing\nto this ADR rather than being rewritten.","tree":{"sha":"ab47c092a70af525588c3048452e3084a9bfc3db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/ab47c092a70af525588c3048452e3084a9bfc3db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f","verification":{"payload":"tree ab47c092a70af525588c3048452e3084a9bfc3db\nparent 688a987a428b2d57af106b91e6eb78ea322adb3f\nauthor Rodrigo Vieira <rodrigodenizads@gmail.com> 1786412296 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786412296 -0300\n\nfix(repo): disable Dependabot (ADR-0016) (#36)\n\nPer user direction, after Dependabot''s first day active opened seven\nPRs in quick succession — one a real problem (@types/node''s major\nbump, unrelated to engines.node, closed separately in PR #33/#28''s\nfollow-up), the rest routine noise. Deletes .github/dependabot.yml\nand closes every open Dependabot-authored PR (#27, #30, #32, #34,\n#35).\n\nosv-scan and Socket (also from ADR-0015) are unaffected — they run on\nevery push/PR independent of Dependabot''s weekly cycle, and still\nsatisfy the CVE/supply-chain-scanning half of the blueprint''s\n\"Dependabot/Renovate, Socket all wired into CI\" DoD line. Dependabot\nspecifically is what''s disabled. ADR-0015 gets a status note pointing\nto this ADR rather than being rewritten.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP