UxYjU3Y2Q0NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/688a987a428b2d57af106b91e6eb78ea322adb3f","sha":"688a987a428b2d57af106b91e6eb78ea322adb3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/688a987a428b2d57af106b91e6eb78ea322adb3f"}],"sha":"fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/fb1d492a481bb7dd3948150261bcede1b57cd44f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/688a987a428b2d57af106b91e6eb78ea322adb3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T01:30:47Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T01:30:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(repo): pin @types/node to engines.node''s major in dependabot.yml (#33)\n\nDependabot proposed @types/node 22.10.2 -> 26.2.0 (PR #28) — a major\nbump with no relationship to this project''s actual \"engines\": {\"node\":\n\">=22.22.2\"} (Node 22). Dependabot has no way to know @types/node\nmust track the runtime engine''s major; left alone it will keep\nproposing whatever the latest major is, silently type-checking this\ncodebase against Node APIs the declared engine doesn''t have.\n\nAdds an ignore rule for semver-major updates on @types/node. Closed\nPR #28 without merging; this must be bumped deliberately, together\nwith engines.node, when the project''s target Node version changes.","tree":{"sha":"defd17b7f4384f599533765005dcb46b0d824f52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/defd17b7f4384f599533765005dcb46b0d824f52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/688a987a428b2d57af106b91e6eb78ea322adb3f","verification":{"payload":"tree defd17b7f4384f599533765005dcb46b0d824f52\nparent 558b76f1e07b4a0b786a7b601b2bb7ee8e515e68\nauthor Rodrigo Vieira <rodrigodenizads@gmail.com> 1786411847 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786411847 -0300\n\nfix(repo): pin @types/node to engines.node''s major in dependabot.yml (#33)\n\nDependabot proposed @types/node 22.10.2 -> 26.2.0 (PR #28) — a major\nbump with no relationship to this project''s actual \"engines\": {\"node\":\n\">=22.22.2\"} (Node 22). Dependabot has no way to know @types/node\nmust track the runtime engine''s major; left alone it will keep\nproposing whatever the latest major is, silently type-checking this\ncodebase against Node APIs the declared engine doesn''t have.\n\nAdds an ignore rule for semver-major updates on @types/node. Closed\nPR #28 without merging; this must be bumped deliberately, together\nwith engines.node, when the project''s target Node version changes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqentHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALlcQAH/SiwAKQP27TF9RVSc5xRmU\nIehP+ZaDFM0FjNLxu/EXr0AQBk4jGcKQAkY