mmits/99eee1784a8b068256112c630d79a0ea0b61a59a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T22:00:30Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T22:00:30Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(repo): standalone remote output + Changesets publish workflow (T020-T028)\n\nStandalone mode''s write-app.ts branch and prompts.ts''s outputPath\nprompt (validated to resolve outside this repo, research D4) already\nlanded in the previous commit alongside monorepo mode; this commit\nadds what makes their output real:\n\n- templates/standalone/: package.json depends on @enterprise-mfe/*\n  at published semver ranges (never workspace:*, FR-017), .npmrc\n  points the @enterprise-mfe scope at GitHub Packages, tsconfig.json\n  inlines config-typescript''s compiler options rather than extending\n  that workspace-only package (it is never published), and README.md\n  states the install prerequisite plainly (FR-020).\n- .changeset/config.json: @changesets/changelog-github wired to this\n  repo, packages/* as the publishable set.\n- .github/workflows/publish-packages.yml: real changeset version/\n  publish, but triggered only by workflow_dispatch or a v* tag —\n  never the push/pull_request triggers ci.yml''s quality job uses\n  (FR-019, SC-006).\n\nVerified: generated a standalone remote to a scratch directory outside\nthis repo — package.json has no workspace:* reference, .npmrc is\ncorrect, and nothing under this monorepo changed. Dry-ran the\nmechanism for real (changeset status, then changeset version, which\nbumped packages/* to 0.0.1 and generated real CHANGELOGs) and reverted\nevery result — proving the pipeline works without a network call to\nGitHub Packages, per FR-019.","tree":{"sha":"f1a01b381f624ec56ca2fd7aaf4398896a51e0bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/f1a01b381f624ec56ca2fd7aaf4398896a51e0bb"},"ur