url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/a38c746f5860175778bdd3af6d27cc3aa2138204/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T22:00:09Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T22:00:09Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(repo): scaffold monorepo remotes, correct by construction (T002-T019)\n\n`pnpm turbo gen remote` in monorepo mode: prompts for mode/name/\nroutePath/label, validates every answer before any file is written\n(FR-002, FR-014), then renders apps/<name> from templates extracted\nfrom apps/dashboard and apps/admin as they actually are (research D1),\nregisters the new remote in remotes.dev.json (research D6 port\nassignment), and appends one line to docs/architecture.md.\n\n- validate.ts / shared-versions.ts: pure, unit-tested (27 tests) —\n  name/route/label legality and collision rules, and every shared\n  singleton and tool version read live from apps/dashboard/package.json\n  rather than baked into a template (research D3), so a generated\n  remote can''t silently drift from check:shared-deps.\n- ModuleFederationPlugin''s default ''var'' library type needs a valid JS\n  identifier; a kebab-case name (this project''s own convention) isn''t\n  one. library.name decouples the internal exposed global from the\n  kebab-case `name` remotes.dev.json/loadRemote() actually key off —\n  found by running a generated remote''s real rspack build.\n- Verified against a real generated remote: pnpm build/test/lint/\n  typecheck/check:boundaries/check:shared-deps all pass with zero\n  manual edits, `pnpm dev` composes it inside the shell (confirmed via\n  a real Playwright check, zero console errors), and the three\n  documented refusal paths (name collision, reserved name, route\n  collision) each exit non-zero leaving the workspace unchanged.\n\nAdds a `turbo-generators` Vitest project so this logic is covered by\nthe existing root `pnpm test`.","tree":{"sha":"982b31ceff8d13301fe25c88fd6f5efd29c40735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/982b31ceff8d13301fe25c88fd6f5efd29c40735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/a38c746f5860175778bdd3af6d27cc3aa2138204","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/a38c746f5860175778bdd3af6d27cc3aa2138204","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKGEzOGM3NDZmNTg2MDE3NTc3OGJkZDNhZjZkMjdjYzNhYTIxMzgyMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/b381d40c52b01b9f251262398b62e5e475548715","sha":"b381d40c52b01b9f251262398b62e5e475548715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/b381d40c52b01b9f251262398b62e5e475548715"}],"sha":"a38c746f5860175778bdd3af6d27cc3aa2138204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/a38c746f5860175778bdd3af6d27cc3aa2138204"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/b381d40c52b01b9f251262398b62e5e475548715/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T21:59:41Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T21:59:41Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"build(repo): add @turbo/gen and Changesets tooling (T001)\n\nThree new devDependencies, each justified per Constitution Principle IX:\n\n- @turbo/gen — Turborepo''s own generator toolkit (Plop under the hood).\n  `pnpm gen` already ran `turbo gen` since sprint 1 with nothing\n  registered; this is the tool the project''s own build system already\n  expects for scaffolding, so no alternative codegen framework is\n  justified (research D2).\n- @changesets/cli — the publishing engine ADR-0007 names explicitly for\n  packages/* to have a real version/publish mechanism, which standalone\n  mode''s dependency resolution requires to exist at all.\n- @changesets/changelog-github — standard pairing with @changesets/cli\n  on a GitHub-hosted repo, so changelog entries link back to PRs/commits.","tree":{"sha":"acc85e53d43f6ff5bcd87f1ed0e3ee2e42a8121b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/acc85e53d43f6ff5bcd87f1ed0e3ee2e42a8121b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/b381d40c52b01b9f251262398b62e5e475548715","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id"