ting quality job — one job,\none pass/fail signal, matching how every other gate already works,\nrather than a second workflow duplicating checkout/install/build.","tree":{"sha":"923089d76b08191a51e467d3b6292007f6b9fdbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/923089d76b08191a51e467d3b6292007f6b9fdbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/292aa53e2ec640d05cbdc4faf6bfc9d9d9cd4a4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/292aa53e2ec640d05cbdc4faf6bfc9d9d9cd4a4e","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDI5MmFhNTNlMmVjNjQwZDA1Y2JkYzRmYWY2YmZjOWQ5ZDljZDRhNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8","sha":"d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8"}],"sha":"292aa53e2ec640d05cbdc4faf6bfc9d9d9cd4a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/292aa53e2ec640d05cbdc4faf6bfc9d9d9cd4a4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:21:48Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:21:48Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"test(shell): prove remote-load failure containment against real failures (US1)\n\nThe failure-containment mechanism (packages/federation-utils, built in\n002-shell-host) had only ever been exercised against simulated loaders.\nFour scenarios now prove it against genuinely unreachable remotes —\nnetwork requests aborted at the browser level (page.route().abort()),\nnot a stopped dev server process, since the suite runs fullyParallel\nagainst servers shared for the whole run (research D1):\n\n- a real unreachable remote shows a contained, retryable failure while\n  the shell''s chrome and the other composed remote stay usable\n- retry recovers without a full page reload once reachable again\n- a remote that failed after a prior successful load shows the same\n  contained state on revisit, not stale content — confirmed empirically\n  that the MF runtime re-fetches the manifest on each new mount rather\n  than serving a cached container, so this scenario is real and testable\n- both composed remotes unreachable at once still leaves the shell''s own\n  chrome rendered\n\nAll four passed on the first run, alongside the existing 8 scenarios,\nwith zero regressions — no bug in the existing containment logic, no new\napplication code needed, exactly as plan.md''s Summary expected.","tree":{"sha":"2028489d218fbc55f15628f38b902cf8a7e791fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/2028489d218fbc55f15628f38b902cf8a7e791fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKGQ1ZGE3OWU0YWRlMGZmZDg4NGI2ZDdhOWJhYzU2YjYzZTBkYzA5ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee","sha":"776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee"}],"sha":"d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/d5da79e4ade0ffd884b6d7a9bac56b63e0dc09e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:17:46Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:17:46Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"docs(repo): break sprint 6 down into 16 executable tasks\n\nDeliberately small: US1 (real remote failure, 4 parallel scenarios in one\nnew e2e spec), US2 (wire pnpm e2e into CI, then prove on a scratch branch\nthat CI actually catches a break), US3 (the closing ADR). One real\ncross-story dependency: the ADR (US3) points at what US1 and US2 proved,\nso it''s sequenced last.","tree":{"sha":"dd26289fcc6a2ae735a786fbbafcef811cce861a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/dd26289fcc6a2ae735a786fbbafcef811cce861a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDc3Njc4N2FjMGU2OTY2YjQ2ZjEyZTg0MmVmYzAwOTNlODMwMzRjZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64","sha":"613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64"}],"sha":"776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/776787ac0e6966b46f12e842efc0093e83034cee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:16:32Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:16:32Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"docs(repo): plan sprint 6 — guard rails\n\nPhase 0/1 design: research (D1-D4), no data-model.md/contracts/ (this\nfeature has no new domain entity or public API — CI config, one e2e\nspec, one ADR).\n\nCorrected mid-plan, not after: spec.md''s own guess for producing a\n\"genuinely unreachable\" remote (stopping a dev server) turned out\nactively hazardous once checked against how the e2e suite runs —\nfullyParallel against dev servers shared for the whole run means killing\none breaks every concurrently-running test. Browser-level network\ninterception (page.route().abort()) produces the same real fetch()\nfailure without that blast radius (research D1). spec.md''s Assumptions\nupdated to match.\n\nZero new dependencies. Constitution Check: PASS.","tree":{"sha":"14e00c4cc29b9b581ca8333c725bfc6f7bf1b229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/14e00c4cc29b9b581ca8333c725bfc6f7bf1b229"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDYxMzI0MGZkNGE1YmEwNWZiNzU5N2E0MTA1MDU0NTg1YjJjZjFkNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/faea8816a4f9f0d4e0534e9945265cdfe10405ab","sha":"faea8816a4f9f0d4e0534e9945265cdfe10405ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/faea8816a4f9f0d4e0534e9945265cdfe10405ab"}],"sha":"613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/613240fd4a5ba05fb7597a4105054585b2cf1d64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/faea8816a4f9f0d4e0534e9945265cdfe10405ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:14:04Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:14:04Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"docs(repo): specify sprint 6 — guard rails, honestly scoped\n\nInvestigated before writing: the constitution''s three named guard rails\n(dependency-cruiser, singleton drift check, remote-load error boundary)\nwere already built and enforced across sprints 2, 3, and 5. Rather than\nmanufacture busywork to fill a sprint number, this spec covers only what\ngenuinely remains:\n\n1. The remote-load error boundary has only ever been proven against\n   simulated failures (002-shell-host, fake loaders) — never a real\n   unreachable remote, because none existed until sprint 4. Now two do.\n2. pnpm e2e isn''t wired into CI — the only documented quality gate CI\n   doesn''t already enforce on every pull request.\n3. A closing decision record, so \"is guard rails done?\" has a definitive\n   answer instead of requiring commit archaeology, and blueprint''s\n   \"standalone-repo parity\" bullet is recorded as sprint 7''s dependency\n   (ADR-0007''s generator output), not a silently-dropped gap.\n\nExplicitly rules out starting the generator''s dual-mode output (FR-011)\n— ADR-0008/Principle V require both remotes done first, which is now\ntrue, but this sprint isn''t that one.\n\nZero [NEEDS CLARIFICATION] markers.","tree":{"sha":"bd3e39440516b9248b098988e3d472622d0c169c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/bd3e39440516b9248b098988e3d472622d0c169c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/faea8816a4f9f0d4e0534e9945265cdfe10405ab","verificati