:"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/63c9852d439d32630979c6bd489d9a886ac1624d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:42:19Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:42:19Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(dashboard): subscribe to live role-change updates (US4 headline proof)\n\nuseEventSubscription(''user:role-changed'', ...) bumps the active-users KPI\nby 1 per event, applied on top of whatever the dashboard''s own fetch last\nresolved (research D3) — no recomputation from admin''s user list, which\nthis remote has no reason to know about.\n\n@enterprise-mfe/event-bus added as a dependency and MF shared singleton,\nmatching every other manifest.\n\nVerified for real, not just asserted: two genuinely separate Playwright\npages in the same browser context (same origin, no shared JS memory) —\none on /dashboard, one on /admin. A role change submitted on the admin\npage updates the dashboard page''s KPI with no reload, proving the\nBroadcastChannel relay actually crosses tabs, not just same-module\ndelivery. A second test confirms a dashboard opened after the role change\nshows fresh state, not a replay (FR-016).\n\nOne real bug in the test itself, not the app: the auth stub starts signed\nout on every page independently (no persistence), so the first attempt\ntimed out waiting for the invite/edit trigger — correctly absent pre-login\n(FR-008). Fixed by signing in on the admin page before opening the modal.","tree":{"sha":"d0eee0b7e26d8039b72292fe605b61aff0fd3051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/d0eee0b7e26d8039b72292fe605b61aff0fd3051"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/63c9852d439d32630979c6bd489d9a886ac1624d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/63c9852d439d32630979c6bd489d9a886ac1624d","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDYzYzk4NTJkNDM5ZDMyNjMwOTc5YzZiZDQ4OWQ5YTg4NmFjMTYyNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/1577575f74de83eda3a364e2e968f2e258b28edf","sha":"1577575f74de83eda3a364e2e968f2e258b28edf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/1577575f74de83eda3a364e2e968f2e258b28edf"}],"sha":"63c9852d439d32630979c6bd489d9a886ac1624d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/63c9852d439d32630979c6bd489d9a886ac1624d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r