,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/6271d4c30b1eafd507fad75668f312254dcf1159/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:29:02Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:29:02Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(event-bus): implement typed pub/sub with BroadcastChannel relay\n\npublish/subscribe over a Map<topic, Set<handler>> for same-tab delivery,\nplus a same-origin BroadcastChannel relay for cross-tab delivery — proven\ndirectly in bus.test.ts by opening a second channel instance with the\nsame name and confirming it receives a publish() call, standing in for a\ngenuinely separate browser tab (research D2, contracts/event-bus-contract.md).\n\nuseEventSubscription wraps subscribe in a useEffect, so no consumer\nhand-rolls the cleanup pair.\n\nfeat(admin): user fixture and list state (pagination, sort, mutations)\n\n27 seeded users (data-model.md) — enough to force pagination at the fixed\n10-per-page size. useUserList owns pagination/sort state and the two\nmutations this sprint needs: addUser (validated: required fields, no\nduplicate email) and changeRole, which publishes ''user:role-changed'' only\nafter the mutation actually succeeds (FR-013).","tree":{"sha":"7ab671524b3a3edbd94e96bcf450043886e372e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/7ab671524b3a3edbd94e96bcf450043886e372e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/6271d4c30b1eafd507fad75668f312254dcf1159","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/6271d4c30b1eafd507fad75668f312254dcf1159","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDYyNzFkNGMzMGIxZWFmZDUwN2ZhZDc1NjY4ZjMxMjI1NGRjZjExNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/bee922db6a9605ad3219479a8a968bf1413843e7","sha":"bee922db6a9605ad3219479a8a968bf1413843e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieir