_federation_expose_App.css carries the smoke component''s\nutility classes.\n\npackages/event-bus scaffolded as a workspace package (no core logic yet —\nthat''s Phase 2). Both apps/admin and packages/event-bus registered as\nvitest projects.","tree":{"sha":"1c05f48a89129b23da4df15c83402d705f4e4a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/1c05f48a89129b23da4df15c83402d705f4e4a35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/bee922db6a9605ad3219479a8a968bf1413843e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/bee922db6a9605ad3219479a8a968bf1413843e7","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKGJlZTkyMmRiNmE5NjA1YWQzMjE5NDc5YThhOTY4YmYxNDEzODQzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a","sha":"91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a"}],"sha":"bee922db6a9605ad3219479a8a968bf1413843e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/bee922db6a9605ad3219479a8a968bf1413843e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:21:30Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:21:30Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"docs(admin): break sprint 5 down into executable tasks\n\n74 tasks across setup/foundational/5 user stories/guard-rails/polish.\npackages/event-bus''s core (publish/subscribe/BroadcastChannel) sits in\nFoundational rather than under any single user story, since both US3\n(publishes) and US4 (subscribes) depend on it and it''s fully testable in\nisolation first.\n\nUS4 — the headline live cross-remote update — has the one hard\ncross-story dependency in this feature: its publish call needs US3''s\nchangeRole to exist first. Everything else is independently orderable.\n\nMVP scope is Phases 1-3: both packages/apps scaffolded and the shell\ncomposing a second real remote.","tree":{"sha":"80c379ec6a8f78cef8b0990baeea237be371fdd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/80c379ec6a8f78cef8b0990baeea237be371fdd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDkxYjA2NTk5ZjNjODdjZmVjYmNlMmRmZTE3MDdiYmJiOTk2NmU2OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/bcd3e9228ddbfcb73694abe110ff0f13cfdb0e79","sha":"bcd3e9228ddbfcb73694abe110ff0f13cfdb0e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/bcd3e9228ddbfcb73694abe110ff0f13cfdb0e79"}],"sha":"91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/91b06599f3c87cfecbce2dfe1707bbbb9966e68a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/bcd3e9228ddbfcb73694abe110ff0f13cfdb0e79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:18:47Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T22:18:47Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"docs(admin): plan sprint 5 — the admin remote and packages/event-bus\n\nPhase 0/1 design: research (D1-D7), data model (User reused, RoleChangedEvent,\nEventMap, admin-local pagination/sort state), and two contracts — the\nevent-bus public API and the registry entry apps/admin fulfills.\n\nZero new dependencies: packages/event-bus is a Map plus the native\nBroadcastChannel Web API, not a pub/sub library — justified in research D2\nas the alternative actually weighed and rejected.\n\nCaught and fixed during research, not after: the spec''s own scenario\ndescribes two separate browser tabs, which an in-memory-only event bus\ncannot reach at all (separate tabs share no JS memory). BroadcastChannel\ncloses that gap without a backend, same-origin, exactly matching how the\nshell composes every remote from one origin.\n\nTwo decisions kept deliberately narrow-scoped rather than extended\nproject-wide: permission gating stays a local apps/admin check rather than\na packages/auth contract change (D4), and pagination/sort controls stay\napps/admin-local rather than extracted to packages/ui (D6) — both\none-consumer decisions today, revisited when a second consumer exists.\n\nConstitution Check: PASS, no violations to justify.","tree":{"sha":"b41db8c002fcff96c870962ca5f833f97d0cb52b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/b41db8c002fcff96c870962ca5f833f97d0cb52b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/bcd3e9228ddbfcb73694abe110ff0f13cfdb0e79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM