ps://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/5b8e0527312c381303867c0f6221984d1977c58b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:51:04Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:51:04Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(dashboard): add activity chart (US3), fix federated CSS loading\n\nrecharts renders to inline SVG (research D3) — no global stylesheet, no\ncanvas registry, nothing to leak into the shell. Distinct loading, error,\nand empty/single-point states, driven by the same shared FetchState as\nthe KPI cards.\n\nOne real, architecturally significant bug found only by inspecting the\ncomposed page in a real browser, not by reading config or an\naccessibility-tree assertion: `exposed/App.tsx` didn''t import its own\n`styles.css` — only `bootstrap.tsx` did. When the shell loads this remote\nvia federation, it fetches only the chunks in `./App`''s own dependency\ngraph; `main`''s chunk (styles.css''s only importer) is never requested.\nEvery dashboard-owned Tailwind class resolved to no generated CSS at all\nwhen composed, collapsing the chart to a 0x0 container. This applies to\nany exposed component''s own styling, not just the chart — every future\nremote needs its exposed entry to own this import, not just its\nstandalone bootstrap.\n\nAdds a ResizeObserver + getBoundingClientRect polyfill to the shared\nvitest.setup.ts: jsdom implements neither, so recharts'' ResponsiveContainer\nnever rendered its children in any project''s tests without it.\n\nVerified for real: apps/shell/e2e now asserts the chart mounts with a\nreal SVG, the shell''s chrome is byte-identical before/after, and no\nchart resources survive an unmount/remount cycle.","tree":{"sha":"365003544498beeadcf618badd7fccd7aa233c30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/365003544498beeadcf618badd7fccd7aa233c30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/5b8e0527312c381303867c0f6221984d1977c58b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/5b8e0527312c381303867c0f6221984d1977c58b","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDViOGUwNTI3MzEyYzM4MTMwMzg2N2MwZjYyMjE5ODRkMTk3N2M1OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7","sha":"52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7"}],"sha":"5b8e0527312c381303867c0f6221984d1977c58b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/5b8e0527312c381303867c0f6221984d1977c58b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:43:40Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:43:40Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(dashboard): add KPI cards (US2)\n\nActive users and usage trend, each with a distinct loading and error\nvisual state (FR-006-FR-008), built on packages/ui''s Card. Lifted the\nsingle useDashboardOverview() call up into App.tsx per data-model.md — KPI\ncards, the chart, and the feed all read from one shared fetch, not three\nindependent ones each paying their own delay.\n\nAdds a dev/test-only ?forceOverviewFailure=1 query param\n(force-failure.ts) so the e2e suite can prove FR-018''s containment\nguarantee against the dashboard''s own data-fetch failure, not just a\nsimulated remote-load failure. Verified for real: the composed shell\nshows the cards'' error state while chrome, navigation, and the rest of\nthe app keep working.","tree":{"sha":"6c104cae55e99efcb626693cca6d93d98e12e442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/6c104cae55e99efcb626693cca6d93d98e12e442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDUyYTNlOThmZmM0ZGVhNjBkYzZjNzczZTllMGZmNmU2Y2RhMjFjYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/e2fb341c555229529b780b0c589b5e458088d614","sha":"e2fb341c555229529b780b0c589b5e458088d614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/e2fb341c555229529b780b0c589b5e458088d614"}],"sha":"52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/52a3e98ffc4dea60dc6c773e9e0ff6e6cda21cb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/e2fb341c555229529b780b0c589b5e458088d614/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:39:58Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:39:58Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"fix(dashboard): make real composition actually work, proven by e2e\n\nThree real bugs found only by running the composed shell + dashboard in a\nreal browser (Playwright), not by inspecting config or unit tests:\n\n1. patchRoutesOnNavigation, not router.patchRoutes: a hard navigation\n   straight to /dashboard (page.goto, same as a real page load) asks the\n   router to match before any effect runs. router.patchRoutes only helps\n   future navigations; patchRoutesOnNavigation is invoked by the router\n   itself at the \"no match yet\" moment, before it falls through to a 404.\n2. apps/dashboard''s rspack dev server sent no\n   Access-Control-Allow-Origin header, so the shell''s cross-origin fetch\n   of the manifest was blocked by CORS with a bare \"Failed to fetch\".\n3. apps/dashboard''s exposed App had no default export;\n   createFederationLoader requires one and failed with \"has no usable\n   default export\" — federation-utils-contract.md documented this exact\n   edge case in 002-shell-host, never exercised until a real remote\n   existed.\n\nAlso moves the router (and its memoized registry/route-discovery\npromises) from module scope into a per-mount factory: the module-scope\nversion leaked memoized state across apps/shell''s own tests, which\nrender <App> multiple times with different fetch mocks per test — caught\nby rerunning the full suite, not just the new e2e spec, after each fix.\n\napps/shell/e2e/dashboard-composition.spec.ts is the first real Playwright\nrun in this project (research D6), proving SC-001 end to end.","tree":{"sha":"cd8e0072b2b486ab39b9c46962cee21faad75748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/cd8e0072b2b486ab39b9c46962cee21faad75748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/c