://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/9c49590715ee66eff0362fdf1da075457b6f65a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:33:16Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:33:16Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"docs(dashboard): correct FR-017 and record the route-patching discovery\n\nFR-017 and quickstart.md previously said registering a remote touches \"no\nfile under apps/shell/src\" — impossible, since the registry file itself\nlives there. Corrected to \"exactly one file\", matching 002-shell-host''s own\nprecedent (SC-003, T040) and what git status actually shows.\n\nAlso records T026a: 002-shell-host built RemoteRegion but deferred wiring\nit into real routes, found only by trying to compose the dashboard for\nreal. Task list updated to include it rather than pretending the original\nplan had already accounted for it.\n\nProgress: T001-T024, T026-T028 complete.","tree":{"sha":"23dcd60106fd5f1d779c14f72c56b9b94c60fa4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/