s.\n\nTwo new dependencies this sprint, each justified in research: recharts (SVG\nchart, no global stylesheet/canvas state — the cleanest isolation story for\nthe third-party-library-in-federation proof point) and @playwright/test\n(deferred by 002-shell-host''s research D7 until a real remote existed to\ncompose; this is that remote). packages/ui also gains a Card component,\nsince no card-shaped primitive existed before this sprint''s KPI cards needed\none.\n\nConstitution Check: PASS, no violations to justify.","tree":{"sha":"7787ed2f2d8fc8df26f85f38cd3ecd729503dbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/7787ed2f2d8fc8df26f85f38cd3ecd729503dbcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/7cdd0f0f67a86c00928125a1ed4709b16b762039","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/