api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/6de3b532afceb25511e2f39cc61792145ff4d74f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:33:09Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:33:09Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"fix(repo): give the boundary gate a same-app carve-out, closing issue #2\n\nRestoring apps to check:boundaries surfaced 13 real violations immediately —\nthe original no-reaching-into-internal rule, bootstrapped before any app\nexisted and never exercised, had no same-app carve-out: it flagged an app\nimporting its own internal/, which is exactly what Principle I requires to be\nallowed. Split into two backreferenced rules, same pattern already used by\nno-cross-app-relative-imports: no-cross-app-reaching-into-internal (app-to-app)\nand no-package-reaching-into-app-internal (packages/scripts reaching into any\napp). Verified: pnpm check:boundaries now passes cleanly against real\napps/shell source.\n\nAlso fixes the root tsconfig.json''s include, which never covered apps/*\n(written in sprint 2, before any app existed) — dependency-cruiser hands that\nfile to TypeScript for resolution, and without apps/* included it couldn''t\nresolve apps/shell''s own module graph correctly.\n\nDeliberately reproducing a NEW cross-app violation to prove the gate end-to-end\nhit a real, unexplained environment bug: dependency-cruiser cannot resolve any\nrelative import needing 2+ ''../'' segments in this checkout, though an\nisolated, config-identical reproduction resolves the same import correctly\nevery time. Tracked in issue #6 rather than skipped. In its place: the three\nrules'' regex logic (including the $1 backreferences) was verified directly\nagainst simulated resolved paths across 7 scenarios, and the 13 real\nviolations found above are organic proof the gate already fires on genuine\ncode, not a synthetic probe.","tree":{"sha":"47ad2be1aa0b3d14c873f409387edde44f19ee30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/47ad2be1aa0b3d14c873f409387edde44f19ee30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/6de3b532afceb25511e2f39cc61792145ff4d74f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/6de3b532afceb25511e2f39cc61792145ff4d74f","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDZkZTNiNTMyYWZjZWIyNTUxMWUyZjM5Y2M2MTc5MjE0NWZmNGQ3NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356","sha":"47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356"}],"sha":"6de3b532afceb25511e2f39cc61792145ff4d74f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/6de3b532afceb25511e2f39cc61792145ff4d74f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:15:14Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:15:14Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(shell): add origin control — the security boundary of the composition\n\njudgeOrigin implements the three rules from data-model.md: entry must parse as\na URL, its origin must be on the allow-list, and the transport must be secure\nunless the host is loopback (spec Assumptions — otherwise nothing runs\nlocally). All four origin-control cases from quickstart §5 are named tests,\nincluding that http://localhost is explicitly ALLOWED — the exception needs\nproof as much as the rule does.\n\nregisterAllowedRemotes runs every registration through judgeOrigin before\ncalling the MF runtime''s registerRemotes(): a refused remote is dropped before\nit becomes a fetch attempt, let alone a RemoteLoadState. Wired into App.tsx\nafter the registry fetch — origin control now runs before any remote code is\nfetched, closing the loop from manifest.ts through to the MF runtime.\n\nProved with a mixed registry (one allowed, one refused): the frame renders\nunaffected, the refusal is logged rather than silent, and only the allowed\nremote reaches registerRemotes (FR-018).","tree":{"sha":"e068f5d96645f0701ec7e98da8026f79b4c259e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/e068f5d96645f0701ec7e98da8026f79b4c259e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKDQ3ZDFlMmViNmViMDg3OTRiYWI0MjE4YjhkZmMyNjk3MTUyMTAzNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550","sha":"a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550"}],"sha":"47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/47d1e2eb6eb08794bab4218b8dfc269715210356"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:09:33Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:09:33Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(federation-utils): add useRemote and RemoteBoundary, resolving to a real region in the shell\n\nuseRemote is a state machine (idle → loading → loaded | failed) driven by a\nplain loader function — no bundler or MF runtime dependency (research D5),\nwhich is what makes every failure mode testable against a hanging or\nrejecting promise before any real remote exists. Four modes covered, one test\neach: rejects, never settles (timeout via fake timers), resolves with no\nusable default export, and a render-time throw contained by RemoteBoundary\nrather than useRemote''s own state.\n\nRemoteBoundary ships without the ''pending'' prop the contract originally\nspecified — dropped rather than given invented semantics. An error boundary\nonly ever sees a thrown error during render; it cannot observe ''not ready\nyet'', so a pending prop had no real meaning here. The contract listed it with\nno accompanying description, which was the tell.\n\napps/shell/src/internal/federation/loader.ts is the one file that imports the\nMF runtime''s loadRemote, keeping federation-utils itself bundler-agnostic.\nremote-region.tsx composes useRemote + RemoteBoundary into what a route will\nrender once a real remote exists (sprint 4); tested now with a mocked\nloadRemote rejection, proving a failed region does not take navigation\nelsewhere with it (FR-012).","tree":{"sha":"a4331b361b10ce1141a2a79578ec3989a34fe151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/a4331b361b10ce1141a2a79578ec3989a34fe151"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKGE5NGRlNTQ4YjMwZDljMTU0NjFkMmY3NWUwOGYxN2EyZWU0ZDU1NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede","sha":"d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede"}],"sha":"a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/a94de548b30d9c15461d2f75e08f17a2ee4d5550"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:39:21Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:39:21Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(shell): wire react-router and prove environment-as-a-file (US2)\n\nExtracted the FEDERATION_ENV resolution logic out of rspack.config.ts into\nresolve-registry-source.ts, a pure function of (env, fileExists) — it was\npreviously inline and untestable by anything except a real rspack build.\nNow unit-tested directly, and rspack.config.ts is a thin caller.\n\nmanifest.ts''s duplicate-name and routePath-collision errors now include the\nenvironment, matching FR-009''s literal requirement to name both the file and\nthe environment — the original messages named only the file.\n\nreact-router wired via createBrowserRouter/RouterProvider, with an explicit\nhost-owned route list (remote-routes.tsx) that both seeds react-router and is\nchecked against incoming registrations for routePath collisions. Empty for\nnow — no remote exists until sprint 4.\n\nBoth success criteria proved by running the real build, not asserted: SC-002\nvia two builds (staging, production) with git status --porcelain apps/shell/src\nbyte-identical before and after; SC-003 by adding one placeholder remote\nregistration and confirming exactly one file appears in git status.","tree":{"sha":"b1239815fa993c152be75a4594ab8c4e0c9e28d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/b1239815fa993c152be75a4594ab8c4e0c9e28d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede","node_id":"C_kwDOTrv84doAKGQyMDNiNmMwMWNlZjBkMGE0M2FiNjA3NTBhY2VhZTRmNjdlOGNlZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commit/c02cfe4d01632c3f981263c888e12fe473415924","sha":"c02cfe4d01632c3f981263c888e12fe473415924","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/c02cfe4d01632c3f981263c888e12fe473415924"}],"sha":"d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/d203b6c01cef0d0a43ab60750aceae4f67e8cede"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/commits/c02cfe4d01632c3f981263c888e12fe473415924/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:56:57Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:56:57Z","email":"rodrigodenizads@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Vieira"},"message":"feat(shell): compose the frame from @enterprise-mfe/ui and @enterprise-mfe/auth\n\nLayout + Nav for chrome, a session indicator using useAuth(), and one\nProtectedRoute-gated area (FR-003). The registry fetch (from Phase 2) runs as\na fire-and-forget effect — the frame never waits on it, matching FR-001 and\nresearch D3''s consequence that an empty or slow registry must not block\nrendering.\n\nProved end to end with a real headless-browser session, not just tests: signed\nout shows the fallback, clicking Sign in resolves the stub and swaps in the\nprotected content, and the session indicator shows the signed-in person''s\nname. This is the sprint''s MVP checkpoint (User Story 1).","tree":{"sha":"b810e5fddfaf9f5deee813959548a6f529f9bde6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/trees/b810e5fddfaf9f5deee813959548a6f529f9bde6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodvieira/enterprise-microfrontend-boilerplate/git/commits/c02cfe4d01632c3f981263c888e12fe473415924","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35712292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodvieira","id":35712292,"login":"rodvieira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzEyMjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodvieir