ples: containers, typography, spacing)\n  2-media-queries.ts (8 examples: mobile-first, orientation, dark mode)\n  3-flexbox-layouts.ts (8 examples: navbar, card grid, sidebar)\n  4-grid-layouts.ts (8 examples: auto-fit, areas, gallery, table)\n  5-responsive-components.ts (7 examples: cards, nav, form, modal)\n\n- Added 3 interview Q&A files (30 questions):\n  1-responsive-fundamentals-qa.md (10 foundational questions)\n  2-media-queries-qa.md (10 media query techniques)\n  3-responsive-testing-qa.md (10 performance & testing)\n\n- Added comprehensive READMEs:\n  interview-questions/README.md (learning paths, exercises)\n  README.md (master navigation, structure, quick reference)\n\n- Cleaned up old monolithic files:\n  Deleted responsive-design-examples.ts\n  Deleted old explanation/README.md\n\nComplete structure: 5 explanations + 5 examples + 3 interview Q&A + 2 READMEs\nTotal: 2500+ lines documentation, 39+ code examples, 30 interview questions","tree":{"sha":"821262c3883d913d828cfe941c0e763193b92456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmohamedsakr-prog/Angular-Topics/git/trees/821262c3883d913d828cfe941c0e763193b92456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmohamedsakr-prog/Angular-Topics/git/commits/09f87b63d201fa965b03cd46d4ccfaa636c0e68a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258584250?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminone070/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminone070/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminone070/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminone070/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aminone070","id":258584250,"login":"aminone070","node_id":"U_kgDOD2muug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminone070/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminone070