om/users/youssef-elsharwedy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-elsharwedy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-elsharwedy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-elsharwedy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-elsharwedy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-elsharwedy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmohamedsakr-prog/Angular-Topics/commits/23e62fa61e43cbd03814ff5964f5276020bb5758/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T09:05:19Z","email":"aslelhikaia@gmail.com","name":"Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T09:05:19Z","email":"aslelhikaia@gmail.com","name":"Developer"},"message":"Refactor ES6+ Fundamentals - split into 5 focused files\n\n- Split monolithic files into 5 focus areas by topic:\n  1. Variables & Scope (let, const, var, block scoping)\n  2. Arrow Functions & Lexical This (syntax, this binding)\n  3. Template Literals & Strings (interpolation, multi-line)\n  4. Destructuring & Rest Operator (objects, arrays, patterns)\n  5. Classes, Modules, Promises & Arrays (OOP, async, functional)\n\n- New Structure:\n  * explanation/: 5 focused markdown files with deep explanations\n  * examples/: 5 focused TypeScript files with practical code (300+ lines)\n  * Master README with navigation and learning paths\n\n- Removed:\n  * explanation/README.md (monolithic - 400+ lines)\n  * examples/es6-features.ts (monolithic - 500+ lines)\n\n- Benefits:\n  * Cleaner separation of concerns by topic\n  * Easier navigation for specific learning goals\n  * Reduced file size for better maintainability\n  * No duplicate content across files\n  * Consistent with TypeScript refactoring pattern","tree":{"sha":"00b2519153066d6f3d0c10c91a68245a53bbfe0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmohamedsakr-prog/Angular-Topics/git/trees/00b2