 functionality and docstrings preserved; trimmed verbose sections.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d54770968dede51d62e4505c36c70d199ac02148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gokks8142/poseidon/git/trees/d54770968dede51d62e4505c36c70d199ac02148"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gokks8142/poseidon/git/commits/eedb0d72a0062cee2b7e5711a4fd6f41012efaef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/gokks8142/poseidon/commit/eedb0d72a0062cee2b7e5711a4fd6f41012efaef","node_id":"C_kwDOTr_hgNoAKGVlZGIwZDcyYTAwNjJjZWUyYjdlNTcxMWE0ZmQ2ZjQxMDEyZWZhZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gokks8142/poseidon/commit/745a97b4bce82b3a134462cc1da48c8c10ece788","sha":"745a97b4bce82b3a134462cc1da48c8c10ece788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gokks8142/poseidon/commits/745a97b4bce82b3a134462cc1da48c8c10ece788"}],"sha":"eedb0d72a0062cee2b7e5711a4fd6f41012efaef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gokks8142/poseidon/commits/eedb0d72a0062cee2b7e5711a4fd6f41012efaef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gokks8142/poseidon/commits/745a97b4bce82b3a134462cc1da48c8c10ece788/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T03:37:58Z","email":"krishnasomu@Krishnas-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Krishna Somu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T03:37:58Z","email":"krishnasomu@Krishnas-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Krishna Somu"},"message":"Day 1: Add dice demo — end-to-end tool-use verification\n\nHand-written roll_dice tool + printing event handler proves the\nprovider → loop → tool pipeline. Verified: tool calls, tool results,\nand text-only responses all work correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"971c4d5474194a2686ab04c5ba5d0c735f1660ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gokks8142/poseidon/git/trees/971c4d5474194a2686ab04c5ba5d0c735f1660ee"},"url":