":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:16:12Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:16:12Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"message":"feat(ui-shell): The Hundred Eyes foundation — tokens, canon, teller window, alert queue\n\nDesign system v1.0 (Paper = fact, Light = analysis):\n- tokens.css: vault greens, paper/ink, brass, rationed phosphor, oxblood;\n  three voices (Playfair/Inter/Plex Mono); mechanical+optical motion tokens\n- Component canon: the Eye (rate-limited blink, velocity iris), WarmthScore\n  galvanometer dial (16/48/96, phosphor trail), ink stamps (seeded jitter,\n  ink-bleed mask), brass lamps, brass-plate buttons, paper fields, TOTP boxes\n- App shell: nav rail, Meridian hairline, Margin of the Watch with the\n  live-WS-driven Eye; auth context over /auth/me\n- Teller window login: credentials -> MFA challenge -> 6 engraved digit\n  boxes -> vault door (600ms, once, reduced-motion honored)\n- Alert Queue: severity in-trays, canonical 36px rows (SHAP chips, taint\n  stamp, SLA burn coloring, micro-dial), WS arrivals with brass shimmer,\n  honest empty/error/skeleton states\n- Typed client generated from contracts/openapi.yaml (npm run gen:api);\n  envelope + RFC-7807; token rotation; zero mock data anywhere (Law 1-3)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54b12a17384708d8eba59bc7fed3f3ee86e32473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/trees/54b12a17384708d8eba59bc7fed3f3ee86e32473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/commits/88d0060d050fe7b4ee4e14bd702a1c8077107199","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235696523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt