alse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commits/fa64b43146211c1c690ad909a172d3adff335eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T08:00:06Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T08:00:06Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"feat(assistant): wire real Gemma via Ollama Cloud\n\nThe PRISM Assistant now talks to a real model (gemma4:31b-cloud on Ollama Cloud)\ninstead of degrading — verified end-to-end: grounded in live data, streamed over SSE.\n\n- config: OLLAMA_API_KEY + ollama_headers helper (Bearer auth for cloud).\n- assistant streaming switched to /api/chat with a system message + auth header;\n  availability probe and /health probe send the key too.\n- Falls back to the grounded reply if a token never arrives (network hiccup).\n- Credentials live in .env only (gitignored); .env.example documents the cloud\n  option with no secret value. CI secret-grep + a tracked-file scan confirm the key\n  is nowhere in the repo (Law 3).\n- Tests kept hermetic: conftest forces assistant_enabled=False so the suite never\n  calls the cloud (fast, deterministic, no token spend). Live path verified manually.\n\nManual check: asked \"how many open alerts?\" with 24 in the DB → Gemma replied\n\"There are currently 24 open alerts. You should prioritize UBI-****-0049\n(IMMINENT, warmth 99.2)\" — correct, masked, live.\n\nRuff green; 35/35 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"012589fd685c4dd512241cce334be017f91afd06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/trees/012589fd685c4dd512241cce334be017f91afd06"}