d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commits/432d61ee954cddccdda7a323cd9d03f10662765f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:50:51Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:50:51Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"feat(graph): Network Graph + Recruiter Map + taint propagation\n\nThe headline investigation surfaces + the ensemble agreement that lifts confirmed\nnetworks into CRITICAL/IMMINENT (PRD §5.6, §5.7).\n\nEngines (proven V2 IP, computed from real transaction edges — Neo4j-optional):\n- FlowGraph neighborhood: BFS subgraph (nodes=accounts, edges=aggregated tx value),\n  node heat = WarmthScore, amber ring = tainted. Plus pattern detection\n  (round-trip / structuring / velocity subgraphs).\n- Recruiter Mapper: detects coordinators fanning out small test payments to many\n  mules; scale classes FACILITATOR..NATIONAL_SYNDICATE.\n- Taint propagation: freezing a confirmed mule seeds decaying taint N hops through\n  the network; folded into WarmthScore as a NET contribution. This is the ensemble\n  agreement — warmth alone caps at HOT; taint lifts connected accounts to\n  CRITICAL/IMMINENT (verified end-to-end in tests).\n\nEndpoints (contract-first):\n- graph: neighborhood/{id}?hops, patterns/{type}, freeze-cluster (MLRO).\n- recruiters: list, {id}/campaign, {id}/freeze-campaign (MLRO, one-click ring freeze).\n- Shared freeze helper propagates taint from every frozen account; single-account\n  freeze now does too.\n\nRuff green; 21/21 tests pass (adds recruiter scale-class, neighborhood, and the\nfreeze->taint->IMMINENT escalation).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7038aab79163f324be8ca0d0bc11d85e56200fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/trees/7038aab79163f324be8ca0d0bc11d85e56200fdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/commits/432d61ee954cddccdda7a323cd9d03f10662765f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129267894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdityaBelhekar","id":129267894,"login":"AdityaBelhekar","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commit/432d61ee954cddccdda7a323cd9d03f10662765f","node_id":"C_kwDOTsFSkdoAKDQzMmQ2MWVlOTU0Y2RkY2NkZGE3YTMyM2NkOWQwM2YxMDY2Mjc2NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commit/fb90bf2e55a5bf183b4449d81a496787b3632bd9","sha":"fb90bf2e55a5bf183b4449d81a496787b3632bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commits/fb90bf2e55a5bf183b4449d81a49678