.com/u/129267894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdityaBelhekar","id":129267894,"login":"AdityaBelhekar","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commits/8f11ead99f2e6fe5597c8e431428a0dd3e9a7866/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:44:19Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:44:19Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"feat(accounts): lookup + forensic detail with role-based PII masking\n\nCompletes the investigation drill path (PRD §5.5):\n\n- Contract: accounts lookup, profile, score-history, transactions, devices,\n  signals, and actions added to openapi.yaml (Law 1 — contract first).\n- Router (gated on VIEW_ACCOUNTS — MLRO + FRAUD_ANALYST only):\n  - GET /accounts        cursor-paginated lookup by ref/holder + risk_tier filter\n  - GET /accounts/{id}   profile; PII masked unless role holds VIEW_PII (MLRO)\n  - .../score-history    WarmthScore trajectory + SHAP per point\n  - .../transactions     cursor-paginated, masked counterparties\n  - .../devices          IMEI/SIM history (masked)\n  - .../signals          current S1–S6 breakdown\n  - POST .../actions     freeze/restrict/kyc-review/unfreeze — requires FREEZE (MLRO),\n                         server re-checks role; never auto-downgrades a human freeze\n- Masking service: holder names + IMEIs masked server-side by role.\n\nRuff green; 18/18 tests pass (adds masking-by-role + freeze-RBAC coverage).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f128f6d85a7dc00936feb444ec7f321f393b1cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/trees/4f128f6d85a7dc00936feb444ec7f321f393b1cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/git/commits/8f11ead99f2e6fe5597c8e431428a0dd3e9a7866","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129267894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdityaBelhekar","id":129267894,"login":"AdityaBelhekar","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commit/8f11ead99f2e6fe5597c8e431428a0dd3e9a7866","node_id":"C_kwDOTsFSkdoAKDhmMTFlYWQ5OW