rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/Argus---prism-/commits/8ed310b88db00504af1240ef5b85a02ff890048a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:17:46Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:17:46Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"chore(foundations): scaffold V3 monorepo, contract v0, backend core, infra\n\nEstablish the Phase-0 foundation for the V3 rebuild under the Three Laws:\n\n- contracts/openapi.yaml v0 — single source of truth (auth, alerts, stream,\n  metrics, simulator). Envelope {data, meta} + RFC-7807 problem+json convention.\n- backend/ — FastAPI app that boots with a real DB. Config, response envelope,\n  problem+json handlers, structured logging, /health with parallel non-blocking\n  dependency probes. SQLite + in-memory fallback so the API runs without Docker.\n- infra/ — docker-compose (postgres, neo4j, redis, ollama, api) + API Dockerfile.\n- CI — ruff+mypy, schemathesis contract check, and the Law-3 secret-grep tripwire\n  that fails the build if key material ever reaches the UI bundle.\n- .gitattributes / .gitignore / .env.example — repo hygiene.\n\nBackend boots clean: ruff green, 3/3 smoke tests pass (health envelope,\nproblem+json 404, SQLite fallback up).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4cb09caa812f01c322b0ead6999a69ca7413980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123