"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/86199a789741314df6b4e4c0b1cb2b6a7d2c320b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:33:16Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:33:26Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"message":"fix(remote): 修复手机断开后桌面在线状态未更新\n\n中继离线通知原先只取消请求，连接仍被视为在线，导致远程连接页面和会话镜像无法及时更新。\n\n收到通知后退回等待握手状态并保留中继连接，设备汇总沿用五秒离线宽限；补充断开、重连及多通道回归测试，并记录发布说明。","tree":{"sha":"4f691cc5f0a5d4fb44494f45cfcb6e99fcd9c750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/4f691cc5f0a5d4fb44494f45cfcb6e99fcd9c750"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/86199a789741314df6b4e4c0b1cb2b6a7d2c320b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/86199a789741314df6b4e4c0b1cb