","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/8ce073148c556bd5b6621885087b9c4517a876e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:08:20Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:08:20Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"message":"fix(remote): 国内可直连的 STUN 优先，桌面端也查询公网地址\n\n手机只配了 Google STUN，在国内要么查不到公网地址、只能退回中继，要么经代理拿到境外节点地址，P2P 画面绕道海外，真机实测往返超过 300 ms；桌面端此前没有配置任何 STUN。小米、哔哩哔哩、芒果 TV 的 STUN 实测 30–40 ms 内返回真实家宽地址，Google 与 Cloudflare 保留为海外备用。iPhone 端的列表待能构建验证时同步。","tree":{"sha":"558f1d1cab631e762e8973aa7ae61fa82d596a32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/558f1d1cab631e762e8973aa7ae61fa82d596a32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/8ce073148c556bd5b6621885087b9c4517a876e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.githu