},"message":"perf(android): 远程桌面画面解码后立即显示\n\nWebRTC 默认的 jitter buffer 为平滑视频通话而设，桌面画面帧大小起伏剧烈时会把帧多压一段；局域网实测网络 1 ms、解码 10 ms，稳态缓冲仍约 85 ms，强制零播放延迟后降到约 60 ms。","tree":{"sha":"7a43a9965bd81546795a89ec9f8eda0c56992170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/7a43a9965bd81546795a89ec9f8eda0c56992170"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/d351f28c0080149a12145a7afef405a61d67c856","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/d351f28c0080149a12145a7afef405a61d67c856","node_id":"C_kwDOTsUsNdoAKGQzNTFmMjhjMDA4MDE0OWExMjE0NWE3YWZlZjQwNWE2MWQ2N2M4NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/57c4fd32bb26aea67d83e806dce96697abfaa735","sha":"57c4fd32bb26aea67d83e806dce96697abfaa735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/57c4fd32bb26aea67d83e806dce96697abfaa735"}],"sha":"d351f28c0080149a12145a7afe