7Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"message":"refactor(desktop): 消息列表的所有写入改经会话消息流 reducer\n\n消息列表原由实时事件、乐观消息、预览与全量历史、回合结束刷新五路写入同一数组，再靠形状比较和文本序号匹配合并，每种新的事件交错都要再加特例。现在这些写入都是 feed reducer 的 action，历史按消息身份合并，切回运行中会话按 currentTurnId 恢复回合；旧协议分支和五个合并模块随之删除（ADR-0146）。","tree":{"sha":"f42852848c13f73c96c1a973a1f96a7afc68bd7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/f42852848c13f73c96c1a973a1f96a7afc68bd7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/bc850b92f648442b7f16264fb1c9b8ef8330b0d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/bc850b92f648442b7f16264fb1c9b8ef8330b0d1","node_id":"C_kwDOTsUsNdoAKGJjODUwYjkyZjY0ODQ0MmI3ZjE2MjY0ZmIxYzliOGVmODMzMGIwZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/49b0cd6c1a2c789b88c999f4f4dc306a5786b6b6","sha":"49b0cd6c1a2c789b88c999f4f4dc306a5786b6b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/49b0cd6c1a2c789b88c999f4f4dc306a5786b6b6"}],"sha":"bc850b92f648442b7f16264fb1c9b8ef8330b0d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/bc850b92f648442b7f16264fb1c9b8ef8330b0d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94226447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bent2685","id":94226447,"login":"bent2685","node_id":"U_kgDOBZ3IDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bent2685","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/fcde2f5170886fa57e40cee6c0bce06cd6b157e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:18:20Z","email":"bent2685@outlook.com","name":"bent2685"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:18:20Z","email":"bent2685@outlook.com","name":"bent2685"},"message":"fix(prompt): 消除模式、人设与项目指令之间的提示词冲突\n\n系统提示词各层（core、工作模式、人设、项目指令）在同一问题上给出\n相反要求且没有裁决规则，模型只能按出现顺序猜，导致「交互」人设在\nCoding 模式下时而先问时而直接改、交付物清单格式不一致等问题。\n\n- core 新增指令优先级规则，按领域划分用户消息、项目指令、人设与\n  自定义指令、工作模式的裁决范围\n- 交付物清单只在 core 定义一次，删除模式里的重复 partial，并去掉\n  与文件链接规则矛盾的「前文不得出现链接」\n- 「交互」人设不再声明独立身份，模式与人设两侧写明谁让步\n- 只点名当前可用的工具，自定义指令与 Vetta CLI 指引加标题，\n  补充 @skill 未命中时的处理，并降低非安全规则的强调词\n- 新增端到端与单元测试，同步架构文档、ADR-0071 修订与发布说明","tree":{"sha":"219fba0cf1a87e77b3922c8ac91fb4279006d8b3","url