0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/commits/49b0cd6c1a2c789b88c999f4f4dc306a5786b6b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:07:59Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:07:59Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"message":"feat(desktop): 新增按身份归约的会话消息流 reducer\n\nADR-0146 的核心：消息列表改由「历史快照 + 带序号的运行时事件 + 本地动作」经单个纯 reducer 得出，按 turnId/messageId 定位目标，历史按 id 合并而不比较列表形状，本地项锚定在其前驱之后。chatMessagesAtom 改为从该状态派生；本提交尚未接入写入方，行为不变。","tree":{"sha":"ed722a7b05f2f70510091159540aceed878e05a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/ed722a7b05f2f70510091159540aceed878e05a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/49b0cd6c1a2c789b88c999f4f4dc306a5786b6b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","follo