flowerwine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:48:07Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"message":"feat(runtime-core): 暴露运行中回合身份并重放本轮工具事件\n\n中途接入的订阅方（桌面端切回运行中的会话）只能拿到开始时间，只好把末尾消息当成当前回合，续跑回合会接到上一轮气泡上；工具执行也不在重放缓冲里，切回后运行中的工具状态丢失。ADR-0146 的消息流恢复依赖这两项事实。","tree":{"sha":"02c2393572f83ee6dc2ad0f6efbaafaf43febe99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/02c2393572f83ee6dc2ad0f6efbaafaf43febe99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/422983be7523880c2f806914283acbe0511ccd36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/422983be7523880c2f806914283acbe0511ccd36","node_id":"C_kwDOTsUsNdoAKDQyMjk4M2JlNzUyMzg4MGMyZjgwNjkxNDI4M2FjYmUwNTExY2NkMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/8ddc6265214e355a6ef8b6c5851cd4efa2b1a1c6","sha":"8ddc6265214e355a6ef8b6c5851cd4efa2b1a1c6","url":"http