.com","name":"flowerwine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:16:56Z","email":"2914518090@qq.com","name":"flowerwine"},"message":"ci(desktop): 各平台构建完即上传安装包，更新清单改由开发者上线\n\n集中发布要等最慢的 macOS x64 构建完，任一平台失败其余安装包也发不出去；更新清单一上传就推给所有用户，上线时机应由开发者掌握。各平台现在构建后直接把安装包传到 R2 与 GitHub Release，latest*.yml 只放到 R2 的 pending/<版本>/ 目录，决策见 ADR-0145。","tree":{"sha":"d09b03aa1acbede12ea24369d1e352b2a18b8271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/trees/d09b03aa1acbede12ea24369d1e352b2a18b8271"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openvetta/open-vetta/git/commits/59f84fafefd52509efdcc2812e6adde6333b74d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98141596?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flower0wine","id":98141596,"login":"flower0wine","node_id":"U_kgDOBdmFnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flower0wine","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/59f84fafefd52509efdcc2812e6adde6333b74d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTsUsNdoAKDU5Zjg0ZmFmZWZkNTI1MDllZmRjYzI4MTJlNmFkZGU2MzMzYjc0ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openvetta/open-vetta/commit/7275a34dcc2102986cfdd393f51c290e2d552c13"